<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">LUKE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thurchisa LUKE Miziek dungjûiin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Thurchisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Miziek dungjûiin</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Thurchisa Luke miziek hin </char>Jisua hih Israelngei sanminringpu lei khâm le mi murdi sanminringpu ani iti a minlang ani. <char style="bk">Luke</char> hin Jisua hih inriengngei kôma Thurchi Sa misîr ranga Pumapa Ratha'n ai koi ani iti chong (4:18) le hi Thurchisa hin mingei nângna murdi mindonpena sip ani iti chong a miziek ani. <char style="bk">Luke</char> miziek hin râisânna chong khom a minlâr ani, aliekin abung bul tienga hin Jisua juong suokna ngeia le among tienga Jisua invâna akalna ngeia hin Luke miziekpu nanâk hin Jisua invâna a kal suole hi rammuola khristienngei iemna hong thuor tie le ânzar tie chong hih Tîrtonngei <char style="bk">Sintho</char> bua hin a miziek sa ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sensâina ngei inik aoma (bung 1-2 le 9-19) (anuoia chong tângpui en roh) ma Thurchisa vaia om, Vântîrtonngei latho le Jisua suok lâia belrihôlngei va pan thurchingei, nâipang tea Biekina ase roi ngei, Samari misa le nâipasal inmangpa chongmintêkngei a om ani. Hi Thurchisa sûnga ai uortak chu chubai thona ngei, Ratha Inthieng chongngei, nupangngei sintumngei le Pathien'n nunsie a ngâidamna roi ngei hih ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptispu John le Jisua suok thurchi le a nâipanglâi roi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptispu John sintho <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jisua baptis a changna le huongna a tongna roi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilee rama Jisua sinthona <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilee renga Jerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hapta nûktak le Jerusalem kôl <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:28-23:56">9:28—23:56</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Inthoinôkna, inlârnangei, le Pumapa invâna a kalna <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Moroitak Theophilus, ei lâia roi juong tung, mi tamtak ngeiin theidôr miziek rangin an pûta. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Aphut renga ha neinunngei amu ngeiin kin lei ril le chong lei phuong anghan an miziek ani. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Masikin nangma Mirittak, abul renga jâttin ânthârlaka sûiin adônin inthârlakin nata rangin miziek ronga ki ti ani. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Tienna thurchi nang an lei ril hah adiktak ani iti na riet theina rangin.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John suok rang leiril masâna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Judea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Judea: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ma hih Palistine rampumpui ahuom ani.</char></note> rama Herod rêngin an lallâiin, ochai a riming Zakariah a oma, ama hah ochai Abijah rûia mi ania, a lômnu riming chu Elizabeth ania, <char style="w">Aaron</char> ochairûia mi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Rich 24:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>An ruonin Pathien mitmun mi diktakin an omma, demnaboiin Pumapa balam le a chong jômin an om ani. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Hannisenla Elizabeth aching sikin nâi nei maka, an ruonin an tar ok zoia. <verse eid="LUK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Hanchu sûnkhat chu Zakariah hah nîngtina asin ngâi angin Biekina ochai sin a thoa. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Ochaingei balam angin mirimhoi hâl rangin taruo sânin ama hah thangin a oma, masikin Pumapa Biekina a sea. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Mirimhoi a hâl lâiin mipui ngeiin apêntieng chubai an lei thoa.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Mirimhoi hâlna mâichâm changtienga han, Pumapa vântîrton indingin a kôm a juong inlâra. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakariah'n amu lehan rolo innîkin a chia. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Hannisenla, vântîrton han a kôma, “Zakariah chi no roh, ne ngênna Pathien'n a rieta, no lômnu Elizabeth'n nâi nang nei pe a ta a riming John ni phuo rang ani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>A suokin chu nangma le mi tamtak mulungrîl râisân atih. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Pumapa mitmûn milien nîng a ta, uain le jûngei reng nêk no nia. A suokni renga Ratha Inthiengin sip a ta, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Tel 6:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Isreal mi tamtak Pumapa an Pathien tieng hong tuong nôk a tih. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Dêipu Elijah anghan rât le hâitakin Pumapa motona sêng a tih. Pangei le nâingei minmun nôk a ta, chongjômloi mingei mindonna satna tieng min hei a ta, Pumapa mingei ata rangin min thokdiem a tih” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref></char></note>a tia. <verse eid="LUK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakariah'n vântîrton kôma han, “mahah inmo ki riet rang? keima laka ka tar zoia, ko lômnu khom a tar zoia,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Vântîrton han, “Pathien makunga inding ngâi Gabriel ki nia, hi thurchi nang ril rang piela juongtîr ki ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Hi chong azora taka juong tung rang ni iemloi sikin, ajuong tung mâka chu chong theiloiin dâirekin om ni tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Mipui ngeiin kholâia an lei ngâka, Biekin sûnga Zechariah a om sôt rai sikin an lei kamâma. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>A hong jôk tena chu a chong thei khâiloi sikin Biekina inlârna ai mu iti an rieta, a kut leh vai a chong zoia. <verse eid="LUK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Biekina a sin rang a zoi suole chu a in tieng a kîr zoia. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Môrkhat suoleh chu a lômnu Elizabeth nâi a vong zoia, thâ rangnga tuol suok loiin a oma. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>“Anûktaka Pumapa'n mi san nôk zoi, ki riming siet, sût minthelna rangin” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua suok rang leiril masâna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elizabeth nâivong, atha ruk nân chu Pathien'n a vântîrton Gabriel Galilee ram Nazareth khopuia a tîra. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Rêng David rûia mi Joseph lômnu biek dôngmate Mary kôma chong juong ichôiin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat 1:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Mary kôma a lûta, “Nu chunga ratha inngamna om rese! Pumapa nu chunga a om, sat nang a vur ok” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Ha chong hah a rieta anîn chu imo ani zoi, tiin a mulung a minjîng oka. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Hanchu, vântîrton han, “Mary chi no roh, Pathien'n ai minlut tak mi nini. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Nâivong na ta, nâipasal nei na ta, a riming Jisua ni phuo rang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat 1:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Mi lien nîng a ta, Ânchungtaka Pathien nâi tîng an tih. Pumapa Pathien'n David anghan Rêng minchang a tih. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32,33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Jakob richingei chunga rêngin om a ta, ânlalna ramin mong tik nei khâi no nih” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Hanchu Mary'n vântîrton kôma, “Mahah kho angin mo anithei ranga? dôngmate kêng ka lani hite” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Vântîrton han a thuona, “Ratha Inthieng nu chunga juong a ta, Pathien Ratha nu chunga om a tih. Masikin kêng nâite inthieng khom Pathien Nâipasala be ani rang. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Nu juorpuinu Elizabeth khom aching an iti hah, a tar ok khoma a nâivongna thâ ruk ani zoi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Asikchu Pathien chu ite a tho theiloi omak,” a ti pea.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Aph 18:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Hanchu, Mary'n, “Pumapa tîrlâmnu ki ni, ni ti lam angtakin ku chunga tung rese,” a tia. Masuole chu vântîrton han ama amâk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mary'n Elizabeth ava pan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Masuole inrangin Mary ânthoka, Judea rama khopui inkhata a se zoia. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Zakariah ina a lûta, Elizabeth chibai amûka. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elizabeth'n Mary chibaimûk a riet lehan a sûnga nâite hah singânsa, Elizabeth Ratha Inthiengin a sipa. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Hanchu rôl inring takin ânieka, “Nang chu nupang lâia mi satvur tak ni nia, na nâivong rang khom hih satvur ani. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Ka Pumapa nûn ni na hongpan hih i ang tak mo ai ni zoi hi? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Nu chibaimûk ki riet lehan ku sûnga nâite râisânin ânchôm ani. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Pumapa chongbê na chunga tung rang ni iem sikin mi satvur ni ni” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mary minpâkna la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Hanchu Mary'n<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam 2:1-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“ka mulungin Pumapa a minpâka,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ki ringnân khom Minringpu Pathien chunga a râisân ok zoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>A tîrlâmnu intem tie a riettit sikin<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref></char></note>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Atûn renga chu mitinin satvur ni tîng an tih.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Sinthothei Pathien han ku chunga sin lientak a thoa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">A riming khom ânthieng ani.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Ruol athar renga ruol thoithar nôk idênin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">Ama mirit ngei chu a moroi ngâia,<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>A bân ranak an chunga a jâra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Mi inpâk ngei chu an mintuona ngei leh chekaminchâi ngâia.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>An sukmun renga rêng alien ngei a kaisuma,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Job 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">Rangâichîn ngei chu a domsâng zoia.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Vonchâmngei chu neinun sân a vâi minkhopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">Ânchongngei chu kut korongin a min rot ngei zoia.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Ei richibulngei kôma a chonginkhâm anghan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">A tîrlâm Isrealngei san rangin a juong zoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Abraham le a richingei kumkhuon a moroi tie riettitna rangin” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:55: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Aph 17:7</ref></char></note>a tia.<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mary hah Elizabeth kôm thâ thum a oma, hanchu a in tieng a se nôk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John suok roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elizabeth nâinei zora ahong chukin chu nâipasal a neia, <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>A bungmingei le a suongsuokngeiin, Pumapa'n lungkham a mu ok iti an rieta, an râisân puia.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Hanchu, sûnriet anîn chu nâite sertan rangin an honga, a pa riming pêlin Zakariah nanâk phuo rang an tia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Och 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Hannisenla, a nûn “nithei nonih, a riming chu John kêng” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Annin, “Hi anga riming hih nin suongsuokngei lâia khom la om ngâi mak” an tipea. <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Maleh a pa kôm han kut leh an chongpuia, nâite riming hah imo ai phuo nuom, tiin an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakariah'n a miziekna rang neinun a zonga, a riming chu John ani tiin a mizieka; an kamâm sabaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Harenghan, Zakariah hah a hong chong thei zoia, Pathien a minpâk kelen zoi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>An kôl revêla om ngei murdi'n an chia, ha thurchi hah Judea tângram muntina ânthang zoia. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Ariet nâmin hi nâite hih i ang takin mo a hong ni rang na? Pumapa sinthotheina ranak laka a chunga a oma, an tia.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zakariah chongphuong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>John a pa Zakariah hah Ratha Inthiengin a sipa, Pathien chong a phuonga.<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Pumapa, Isreal Pathien chu minpâk ei tih u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">A mingei san rangin a juonga, a mojôk ngei zoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>A tîrlâm David richi renga jôkna riki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:69: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ranakrât </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khom ei ti thei</char></note> mi pêk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Zora sôt tak renga dêipungei kôma a lei khâm anga han,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Ei râlngei le mi demngei renga mi mojôka,<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>A chongkhâm inthieng ei richibulngei kôma minlang rang ai ti riet titin.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73-74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73-74"/>Ei richibul Abraham kôma a chongkhâm ei râlngei renga mi san minjôka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">chi loia a sin ei tho theina rang le,<verse eid="LUK 1:73-74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Ei damsûnga a mitmua inthieng le adika ei om theina rangin.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Nangma ka nâi, Ânchungtaka Dêipu nang tîng an ta,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:76: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">A lampui sin rangin, Pumapa motona sêng ni tih.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>A mingei an sietna ngâidama omin, Sanminringna chong ril ni tih.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Ei Pathien chu mi lungkham thei le moroithei ania,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">Masikin ei rangin sanminringna khuovâr mi minsuok pe a ta;<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Thina dâilîm ijîngna nuioa omngei, Invân renga êlminvâr a ta,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:79: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">Ei kalchôina rathangamna lampui tieng mi tuong a tih” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Hanchu, nâite hah taksa le ratha tieng a hong insôn tira, Isreal mingei lâia ânlâr mâka chu ramchâra a om ani.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua suok roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Malâiahan, Rêng Caesar Augustus Rom sorkar ramop murdi riming miziek rangin chong a pêka. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Hi intelnapui motontak hi syria rama Kuirinius governor chang lâitak ani. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Mitinin anni khopui chita riming miziek rangin an sea. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4-5"/>Joseph khom David inkuo le a richia mi ani sikin, a lômnu biek Mary inrâidîm lehan Galilee ram Nazareth khopui renga Judea ram, David suokna, Bethlehem khopuia riming miziek rangin an sea. <verse eid="LUK 2:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Hanchu, Bethlehem'a an om lâitakin nâi nei zorân a hong de zoia. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Nâilutîr pasal a neia, puon leh a thoma, khuol tung in an keng khâiloi sikin sa bukhênga a min jâl zoi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Belrihôlngei le vântîrtonngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ma rama han, belrihôlngei jâna an belri ngâkin rajâia an oma. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Pumapa vântîrton a juong inlâra, Pumapa roiinpuina vârin a êla, rolo innîkin an chia. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Vântîrtonin, “chi no roi, Thurchisa râisân omtak ninta rang le mitin ta rang ku juong mintung kêng. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Avien hin David khopuia Minringpu, Pumapa Khrista a suok zoi. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Sîn nin tho theina rang chu, nâitesen, puona thom sakhênga jâlin mûng nin tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Harenghan, vântîrton kôma han, invân râlmingei tamtak an juong oma, Pathien an minpâka.<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Invân Ânchung taka Pathien Roiinpui rese.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">Philchunga a râisânna ngei chunga inngêina lêng rese,” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Hanchu, vântîrtonngeiin an mâk ngei lechu, belrihôlngei han, Pumapa'n mi ril, neinun juongtung a en rangin, Bethlehem'a se ei ti u, an tia. <verse eid="LUK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Hanchu, an se laia, Mary le Joseph le sakhênga jâl nâite hah an va mua. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Vântîrtonin, nâite chungroi ai rilngei hah belrihôlngeiin an ril ngeia, <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>a riet ngei murdi'n kamâm a om tatak an tia. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Mary'n ha chong ngei hah a mulungrîla mindonin a vong tita. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Vântîrtonin a rilngei lam takin jâttinrêng an va mua, an riet sikin Pathien minpâk pumin an kîr nôk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua riming an phuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Och 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref></char>
    </note>Hanchu sertan rang ni sûn riet a hong chukin chu, sûnga a om lâia vântîrtonin ai phuo sai, a riming, Jisua an phuo zoia.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Biekina an minlang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Moses balam chongpêk angin minthieng rang ni ahong chukin chu, Joseph le Mary'n an nâite Pumapa kôma minlang rangin Jerusalem Biekina an hong puia. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Balam lekhabua, “Nâilutîr pasal kai chu Pumapa ta rang ani,” itia ânziek anghan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Jôk 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Pumapa balam anghan vasu bop khat mo, pharvali bop khat mo, an pêk sa rang ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:2">Och 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 13:12">12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ma zora han Jerusalema a riming Simeon an ti a oma, ha mi hah mi sa, Pathien minlut mi tak ania, Isreal jôk rang ni ngâkin, a chunga Ratha Inthieng a oma. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Pumapa chonginkhâm, Messiah a mu mâka thi no nih, itia inkhâm ani. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Ratha ruoiin Simeon hah Biekina a sea. Balam anga achunga sin rangin a nû le a pa'n nâite Jisua, Biekina an hong puia. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeon'n nâite a poma, Pathien kôm râisânchong a rila;<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Pumapa, atûn chu no chongkhâm angin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">Ni tîrlâm hih rathangamin ni na man se rang ani zoi.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Ki mit lelên na sanminringna a mu zoi,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Mitin mu ranga ni mintuo hah.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Nu lungdo, Jentailngei kôma inlang rang vâr le<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">Ni mi Isrealngei roiinpuina rang chu” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Nâite chungroi Simeon'n ai misîr hah a nu le a pa'n an kamâm sabak ani. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Hanchu Simeon'n, sat a vura, a nu Mary kôma, “Hi nâite hih Pathien ithang, Isreal lâia mi tamtak inmangna rang le jôkna rang ani. Pathien sînthona mi tamtak ngei makhal rang nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Mi mindonna inthup minlang a ta, khandai angai angin ngâisietnân na mulung sunkhoi a tih,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36-37"/>Mahan dêipu meithâi atar inkhat, a riming Anna an ti, Asher rûia mi, Phanuel nâinupang a oma. kum sari vai inneiin a oma, kum sômriet minli meithâiin a oma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:36-37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kum sômriet minli meithâiin a oma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama hah kum 84 tar ani.</char></note>. Biekin mâk loiin a sûn a jânin bu ngêia Pathien Biekina, chubai thôn a om ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 2:36-37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Ma zora taka han a hongtunga, Pathien kôm râisânchong a rila, Jerusalem jôkna ranga Pathien lei ngâk ngei kôma khom nâipang Jisua thurchi a misîr pe sa zoi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazareth'a an kîr nôk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Pumapa balam chongpêka, an thotum an tho zoiin chu Joseph le Mary hah Galilee rama, an khuo Nazareth'a an kîr nôk zoi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat 2:23</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Hanchu, nâite hah a hong liena a hong rât tira, vârnân a sipa, Pathien satvurnangei a chunga a oma.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nâipang Jisua Biekina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kumtin, Jisua nû le pa Kalkân kût mang rangin Jerusalema an se ngâia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Jôk 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Bal 16:1-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Jisua hah kum sômleinik a hong nîn chu, kûta an hong se puia. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Kût aheka anîn chu an juongkîr pui nôka, ania Jisua chu Jerusalema ala châma, a nû le a pa lakin riet mak ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>A lômngei lâia se nîng a tih, tiin an mindona, sûnkhat lam an se suoleh, a ruolngei le an sûngsuokngei kâra an rok titira, <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>anitachu, mu mak ngeia, a rok rangin Jerusalema an kîr nôka.<verse eid="LUK 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>A sûnthum nin chu, Biekina Juda minchupungei kôma insungin, an chong rangâi le chong rekelin an va mu zoia. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>A vâr taka a chongthuon lam a riet murdi'n an kamâma, <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>A nû le a pan an va mûn chu an kamâma, a nûn a kôma, “Nâia khoithomo hi anga mi no tho, kângdoi takin na pa leh nang kin lei rok bang kêng ani zoi” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>“Ithomo minin rok? Ka Pa ina ko om rang hih nin riet loi mini?” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Hannisenla a thuonna hah a mindona chang riet mak ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Hanchu, an kôm Nazareth'a a sea, an chong jômin a oma, a nûn chu neinun omtie ngei nâm a mulungrîla a vong tit ani.<verse eid="LUK 2:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Hanchu Jisua hah taksa tieng le vârna tieng a hong insôn tir tira, Pathien le miriem mitlûtin a hong om tir zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Chvr 3:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John tanghâi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-8">Mat 3:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joh 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Hanchu, Teberius Caesar Rêng chang a kum sômleirangana, Pontius Pilat Judea rama governor ania, Herod Galilee rama ânlal lâiin, A nâipa Philip, Iturea le Trachonitis rama ânlal lâiin, Abilene rama Lysanias ânlal lâia han, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Annas le Caiaphas ngei hah Ochai Inlal annia. Ma zora lâia han ramchâra Zakaria nâipasal John kôma Pathien chong a juong tunga. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Hanchu, John'n Jordan Tuidung pang revêl ramtina a se titira, “Nin sietnangei renga insîr ungla baptisma chang roi, hanchu Pathien'n nin sietnangei nangni ngâidam a tih” tiin chong a rila.<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Dêipu Isaiah lekhabua miziek anghan: <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40:3-5</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Ramchâra mi inkhat iniek rôl han,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Pumapa lampui sin ungla, a lôna rang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">A lampuingei mintûn roi.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Vakuong tin minsip nîng ata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Muol, tang tin mincham nîng atih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Lampui akôi ngei mintûn nîng ata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Lampui anthir ngei minnâm nîng atih.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Hanchu mitinin Pathien sanmingringna mûng an tih.”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>
    </note>Hanchu, John kôm baptis chang rangin mipuingei an honga, an kôm, “Murûlngei o!” “Pathien dûk juong mintung rang renga jôk rangin tumo nangni ril? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Nin sietnangei nin insîr tatak iti nin nunchana minlang roi, Ei richibul Abraham kêng aninga ti khâi no roi, Pathien'n hi lungngei khom hih Abraham richisuonpârngei a minchang thei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Joh 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Thingkung tin aruzung idêna phûr rangin reipui a om chit ani zoi. Thingkung tin mara sa ânra loi nâm chu phûrpaia meia pai nîng atih,” a tia. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Mipuingei han, “Hanchu, Imo kin tho rang ani zoi,” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Ama'n a thuona, “Kâncholi abop a dônngeiin a dônloingei sem ungla, sâkruo a dônngeiin a dônloingei sem ngei roi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luk 7:29</ref></char></note>Sum rusuongpungei senkhat baptisma chang rangin an honga, a kôma, “Minchupu, imo kin tho rang?” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>“Balam pêna chu rusuong no roi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Râlmingei khom an honga a kôm, “Keinite imo kin tho rang?” an tia. An kôma, “Tute sum rangrâtin lâk no ungla, dikloiin mi nôn no ungla, nin loa han nin mulung minchuk roi,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Mipuingeiin John chungroia sabeina neiin, Messiah ai ni duoi mini tiin an mindona. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Hanchu, John'n, “Keiman chu tuiin nangni ka baptis ngâia, keima nêka roiinpui uol mi a juong ani. Keima chu a kekok sût rang luon inhoi mu-ung. Ama han Ratha Inthieng le meiin nangni baptis a tih,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>“A jâpna rang relei a chôia, jâp a ta, butak hah sapanga thun a ta, arishi kai chu mei thi ngâiloia hâl minmang a tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>An om lam thûlna rang mohôknân lam tamtakin thurchi Sa a ril ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19,20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Herod'n neinun tamtak saloi a tho pênah, a nâipa Philip lômnu Herodias lômnua a nei sikin John'n a ngoa. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Ma nêka saloi uol thôn, Herod'n, John hah intâng ina a khum zoi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua baptisma a changna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Hanchu mipui murdi baptisma an chang zoiin, Jisua khom baptisma a changa. Chubai a tho lâitakin, invân ân onga. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aph 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lap 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char></note> Pharvali angin, Ratha Inthieng a chunga a juongchuma, Invân renga chong ajuon ringa, “Ka nâipasal moroitak ni ni, na chunga ku mulung arâisân ok,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua richibulngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Jisua'n a sin a phuta han kum sômthum a nia. Mi mindonin chu Joseph nâipasal ania. Ama hah Heli nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Ama hah Mathat nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:24">Ama hah Levi nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:24">Ama hah Melchi nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:24">Ama hah Janna nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:24">Ama hah Joseph nâipasal ani.<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Ama hah Mattathias nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:25">Ama hah Amos nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:25">Ama hah Nahum nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:25">Ama hah Esli nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:25">Ama hah Naggai nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Ama hah Maath nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:26">Ama hah Mattathias nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:26">Ama hah Semein nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:26">Ama hah Josech nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:26">Ama hah Joda nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Ama hah Joanan nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:27">Ama hah Rhesa nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:27">Ama hah Zerubbabel nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:27">Ama hah Shealtiel nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:27">Ama hah Neri nâipasal ani.<verse eid="LUK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Ama hah Melchi nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:28">Ama hah Addi nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:28">Ama hah Cosam nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:28">Ama hah Elmadam nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:28">Ama hah Er nâipasal ani.<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Ama hah Joshua nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:29">Ama hah Eliezer nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:29">Ama hah Jorim nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:29">Ama hah Matthat nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:29">Ama hah Levi nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Ama hah Simeon nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:30">Ama hah Judah nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:30">Ama hah Joseph nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:30">Ama hah Jonam nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:30">Ama hah Eliakim nâipasal ani.<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Ama hah Melea nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:31">Ama hah Menna nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:31">Ama hah Mattatha nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:31">Ama hah Nathan nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:31">Ama hah David nâipasal ani.<verse eid="LUK 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Ama hah Jesse nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:32">Ama hah Obed nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:32">Ama hah Boaz nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:32">Ama hah Salmon nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:32">Ama hah Nahshon nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Ama hah Aminadab nâipasal,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:33">Ama hah Admin nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:33">Amah hah Arni nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:33">Ama hah Hezron nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:33">Ama hah Perez nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:33">Ama hah Judah nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Ama hah Jokob nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:34">Ama hah Isaac nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:34">Ama hah Abraham nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:34">Ama hah Terah nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:34">Ama hah Nahor nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Ama hah Serug nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:35">Ama hah Reu nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:35">Ama hah Peleg nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:35">Ama hah Eber nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:35">Ama hah Shelah nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Ama hah Cainan nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:36">Ama hah Arphaxad nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:36">Ama Shem nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:36">Ama hah Noah nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:36">Ama hah Lamech nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Ama hah Methusela nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:37">Ama hah Enoch nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:37">Ama hah Jared nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:37">Ama hah Mahalaleel nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:37">Ama hah Kenan nâipasal ania,<verse eid="LUK 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Ama hah Enosh nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:38">Ama hah Seth nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:38">Ama hah Adam nâipasal ania,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:38">Ama hah Pathien nâipasal ani.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n methêmna a tong roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mk 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Ratha Inthienga sipin, Jisua hah Jordan dung renga a hongkîra, Ratha ruoiin ramchâra han a se zoia. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Mahan Diabolin, sûn sômminli a methêma, ma zora han ite a sâk loi sikin a von achâm sabak zoia. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Diabolin, a kôma, “Pathien Nâi ni nîn chu hi lung hih vâipôl manchang roh,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Bal 8:3</ref></char></note>Jisua'n a thuona, “Pathien lekhabu'n, vaîpôl riemin miriem ring thei nonih ati,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Hanchu, Diabolin, muol insângpa taka a tuong nôka, rammuol pumpuia rêngramngei phûkhatin a min ena. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>A kôma, “Hi ngei chunga rachamneinangei le rochonngei hi nang pêk ki tih, ko kôma ipêk ani zoi, ku nunuom kôm ke pêk thei. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Chubai ni mûk inla anrêngin nang pêk let ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Bal 6:13</ref></char></note>Jisua'n, “Pumapa na Pathien mang chubai mûk inla, ama sin mang tho roh ati,” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Hanchu, Diabolin Jerusalema a tuonga, Biekin sîp ânzumna taka a dara, “Pathien Nâi ni nîn chu inchôm roh, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10,11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Lap 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></note>Lekhabu'n, Pathien'n a vântîrtonngei nang dom rangin juongtîr a ta, <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>an kutin nang dom an ta, ne ke khom lungin inde no tinih ati,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Bal 6:16</ref></char></note>Jisua'n, Lekhabua, “Pumapa na Pathien minsin no roh, ai ti kêng,” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>A methêmna rang murdia a methêm zoiin chu, Diabolin chuminrên danga rangin a mâk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Galilee rama sin a phut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mk 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Hanchu, Jisua hah Ratha Inthieng sinthotheina neiin Galilee rama a kîr nôka, ha ram sûnga han a thurchi ânthang zoia. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Inkhom inngeia mi a minchu ngeia, mi murdi minpâkin a oma.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazereth'a Jisua hengpaiin a om</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Hanchu, Jisua hah a seilienna khuo Nazereth'a a sea, Sabathnia a tho ngâi lamin Synagog taka a sea, Pathien lekhabu pore rangin ândinga. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Dêipu Isaiah lekhabu an pêka, lekha zuot hah a phara, hi miziek omna hih a porea.<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18,19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“Inriengngei kôma Thurchisa misîr rangin mi thangsuok sikin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Pumapa ratha ka chunga a om,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Suoka ântâng ngei kôma jôkna chong min phuong rangin ni tîr ani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Mitcho ngei mit vâr nôkna rang le mi nuomlo ngei jôkna rangin,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Pumapa'n a mingei an jôkna rang zora a hongtung zoi iti phuongsa rangin,” iti hih.<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Hanchu Jisua'n lekha hah a juota, adarpu a pêka, ânsunga, Inkhom ina mi murdi mit ama chunga korong an ena. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Hanchu an kôma, “Hi lekhabu nin kôma porea om hih avien hin adikin nin kôma a hongtung zoi,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>A chongbâi suok lungkham chong misîrin, an mulungrîl a tôna, kamâm a om an tia, “Hi mi hih Joseph nâipasal nimak mo?” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Hanchu an kôm, nangnin hi chongmintêk, “Doctor, nethenin indam roh, Capernaum'a ni sinthongei, kin lei riet ngei khom hah hin na khuoa hin sin roh, ni la ti ngêt nin tih” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Joh 4:44</ref></char></note>Jisua'n, “Adiktakin nangni ki ti, Dêipu, tutên anni khuoa modôm ngâi mak ngei,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Rêng 17:1</ref></char></note>“Rangâi ta u, hih adik ani, Elijah zora lâiin Isreal rama meithâi tamtak an oma, kumthum in-ang ruo juong loiin a oma, an ram pumpui mâitâm achula. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Rêng 17:8-16</ref></char></note>Isreal rama meithâi inkhat Sidon rama Zarephath khuomi kôma tiloi chu Elijah hah tute kôma itîr ni mak. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Rêng 5:1-14</ref></char></note>Dêipu Elisha zora lai khomin Isreal rama mi phâr tamtak an oma, hannisenla, tute dam loiin, Syria rama Naaman mang kêng mindamin a om,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Synagog mipuingei han, a chong hah an rietin chu an ningthik oka, <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>an inthoia, an khopui rôlsora namthâk rangin khopui renga an mojôk paia. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Hannisenla, mipuingei lâi renga a relpaia, a rotpat zoi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ratha saloi nei mi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Hanchu, Jisua Galilee rama Capernaum khopuia a sea, Sabathnin mingei a minchua. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note> Rachamnei taka a minchu sikin an kamâm oka.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Synagog taka han mi inkhat ramkhori ratha dôn a oma, rôl inring takin ânieka. <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“O! Nazereth Jisua, Imo lo rang mini ti? Mi minmang ranga hong mo nini? Nang ki riet, Pathien tîrton inthieng nini!” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Jisua'n, “Dairek inla, a sûng renga hong jôk roh!” a tia. Ramkhori han an makunga, a minjuon raka, min na loiin a sûng renga a hong jôk zoia. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>An rêngin an kamâma, “Khoi chongbai tak mo ani zoi? roinei le rachamneia ramkhoringei chong a pêka an hongjôk hi,” an intia. <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Hanchu ha rama han mun tina Jisua riming ânthang zoia.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Simon tarpi a mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14">Mat 8:14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-31">Mk 1:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Hanchu, Jisua Synagog renga a jôka, Simon ina a sea. Simon tarpi ritun inrik taka nân a lei oma, ama rangin Jisua an ngên pea. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>A kôla avan dinga, a ritun hah a ngoa, a natna, harenghan a hong boia, ânthoia anni ngei sin a tho pe ngei zoi.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi tamtak a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">Mat 8:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:32-34">Mk 1:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Hanchu kholoi nisa tak nûkin, natna tin renga damloingei Jisua kôma an hong tuonga, an chung chita a kut a minngama a mindam ngei rieia. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Hanchu “Pathien Nâipasal nini,” itia iniekin ramkhoringei khom mingei sûng renga an jôkpai zoia, Messiah ani iti an riet sikin, Jisua'n ramkhoringei hah an chong rang phal ngei mak.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Synagog taka Jisua chongril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Hanchu khuo ahongvârin chu, khopui a mâka mun inthimna a sea, mipuingeiin an roka, an mûn chu, anni mâk loia la châm rangin an pûta. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Hannisenla, Jisua'n an kôma, “Pathien Rêngram Thurchisa hih khopui adadangei khoma misîr rang piela itîr kêng ki ni,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Hanchu, Galilee rama Synagog tina thurchi a misîr zoi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ruoisi masa ngei a koina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mat 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mk 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char>
    </note>Sûnkhat chu, Jisua Genesaret dîl rakhama ândinga, mipuingeiin Pathien chong rangâi rangin an neng ruruia. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Tuipanga, ngasûrpungeiin an lên an rusûk kâra an lei mâk rukuong inik a mua. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Simon rukuong lelea han a chuonga, a kôm, tuipang renga intôl viet rangin a ngêna, hanchu, rukuonga ânsunga, mipuingei a minchu ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>A chong zoiin chu Simon kôma, “Tui inthûkna tieng rukuong min se inla, nga sûr rangin nin lênngei vôr roi,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Joh 21:3</ref></char></note> “Pumapa, jân sôt kin vôra ite man makme, nikhomrese, no chongpêkin lênngei vor nôk ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Joh 21:6</ref></char></note> Hanchu an vôra anin chu, nga tam sabak an khuma, an lênngei achet vavânga. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Asân rangin rukuong danga an lômngei kutin an jâpa, an honga rukuong inika a ngim vang dôr an thun minsip ruruoia.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Hanchu, Simon Peter'n neinun omtie a mûn chu, Jisua rukuonga khûkinbilin ânboka, “Pumapa, mi mâksan roh, mi nunsie kêng kin ni,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Ama le a malngeiin an nga sûr tamrai sikin, an kamâm oka. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Simon champui, Zebedee nâingei, Jacob le John khomin kamâm a om an ti saa. Hanchu, Jisua'n Simon kôma, “Chi no roh, atûn renga chu miriem sûr ni tih zoi,” a tipea <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>An rukuongngei tuipanga an kaisuoa, neinun murdi mâk rieiin Jisua an jûi zoi ani.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n miphâr a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Voikhat chu, Jisua khopui khata a om lâiin, mi inkhat aphârin atuom a oma, Jisua a mûn chu, a mâiruotin ânboka, “O Pu, nu nuoma anin chu ni na manthieng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">minthieng </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ma rih hi balam angin mi aminim angin an mindon ngâi.</char></note> thei,” tiin a ngêna. <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Jisua'n a kut le a tôna, “Ku nuom hong inthieng ta roh,” a tia. Harenghan aphâr hah a boipe riei zoia. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Och 14:1-32</ref></char></note>Hanchu, Jisua'n a kôma, “Tute ril no roh, ania ochaingei kôm van en inla, mi murdi'n na dam zoi iti an rietna rangin, Moses Balam anghan inbôlna pêk roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Hannisenla, Jisua thurchi ânthang uol uola, a chongril rangâi rang le an natnangei mindam rangin mipuingei Jisua kôma an hong intûpa. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Hannisenla mun inthimna a sea ava chubai ngâia.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n phalkhatthi a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Sûnkhat chu Jisua'n mi a minchua, a kôla Phariseengei le Balam minchupungei an insunga, Galilee le Judea ram khopui renga le Jerusalem renga hong an nia. Mi mindam theina rangin Pumapa Ratha Jisua chunga a oma, <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Phalkhatthi inkhat a jâlmun leh an hong rojôna, in sûnga Jisua makunga se rang an bôka. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Ania, mipui tam sikin lût thei mak ngeia. Masikin, in chung tieng an kal puia, inchung an mo-onga aridîn taka, Jisua makunga a jâlmun leh an juong musuma. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n an taksôn tie a mua, a kôma, “Ni sietnangei ngâidam ani zoi,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Hanchu Balam minchupungei le Phariseengei han, “Ma angtaka Pathien rilminsiet hih tumo ai ni! Pathien mang kêng nunsie ngâidam thei,” anin tia. <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Jisua'n an mindonna a rieta, “Ithomo ma anga nin mindon? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Ni sietna ngâidam ani zoi iti le, inthoi inla lôn roh iti hih khomo a ti abai uol? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Miriem Nâipasal hin rammuola hin nunsie ngâidam theina ranak a dôn iti nangni minlang pe ki tih,” a tipe ngeia. Hanchu, phalkhatthipa kôma han, “Inthoi inla nu puonpha lak inla, na ina se ta roh nang ki ti,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Harenghan, an motona ânding lita, a jâlna puonpha a lâka, Pathien minpâk pumin a in tieng a se zoi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>An rêngin kamâmin an chia, “Avien chu hi ang taka neinun inkhêl ei mu hih,” tiin, Pathien an minpâk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Levi a koina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Masuole chu, Jisua a sea, sumrusuong ngâi a riming Levi Office a insung a mua, Jisua'n a kôma, “Ni jûi roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Hanchu neinun murdi mâkin a jûi zoia.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Hanchu, Levi'n Jisua rang a ina bukhalai otna a thoa, sumrusuong ngâi mi tamtak le mipuingei a siela. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char></note> Hanchu pharisee senkhat le Balam minchupu senkhat ngeiin Jisua ruoisingei an makhal ngeia, “Ithomo sumrusuong ngâi ngei le nunsaloi ngei leh nin sâka, nin nêk ngâi” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Mi adam ngeiin doctor nâng ngâi mak ngeia, damloi ngeiin kêng an nâng ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Midik ngei ralam ranga juong ni mu unga, mi nunsie ngei ralam ranga juong kêng ki ni,” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bungêi chungroia rekelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Mi senkhatin Jisua kôma, “John ruoisingeiin bungêiin an chubai ngâia, Pharisee ruoisingei khomin ha anga han an tho ngâia, hannisenla, na ruoisingeiin chu ngêi ngâi mak ngeia?” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Jisua'n an kôma, “Inneina khuolmingei hah moipumapa an kôm a om kâr chu bu nin min ngêi thei rang mini? Ni thei no nih. <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Hannisenla, an kôm renga moipumapa an tuongpai nikhuo la tung a ta, ha tikin chu la ngêi an tih” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Jisua'n hi khom hih a misîra, “Tutên puon thar khêrin puon muruo chetpho ngâi mak ngei, pho ngân senla, athar han kaiset a ta, puon hâr thar le puon muruo hah inmun no nih. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Tutên uain thar savun ûm muruoa thun ngâi mak ngei, thun ngân ta senla, uain thar han savun ûm hah mûtkhoi a ta, inbuokpai a ta, savun ûm khom siet a tih. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Masikin, uain thar chu savun ûm thara thun an tih. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Tutên uain muruo nêk nûkin athar nuom ngâi mak, uain muruo asa uol sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Sabathni roia chongrekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Bal 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jisua'n Sabath nîn loilâi a pala, a ruoisingeiin buvûi an china, an kutin an muoi minsâia, an sâka. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Pharisee senkhat ngeiin, “Ithomo, ei Balamin Sabathnia tho loi ranga ai ti hah, nin thoa?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Jisua'n an kôma, “David le a mingeiin an vonchâm lâia an itho hah nin pore ngâi loi mini? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Och 24:9</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref></char></note> Pathien Ina a sea, Pathien ranga ipêk, Ochaingei tiloiin chu tûte sâk rang Balam niloi vâipôl a laka, a sâka, a mingei a minsâk hah?” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Hanchu Jisua'n, “Miriem Nâipasal hih Sabathni Pumapa ani” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miriem kut phalkhatthi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Hanchu, Sabathni danga chu Jisua Synagog taka a sea, a minchu ngeia, mahan mi inkhat kut changtienga phalkhatthi a oma. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Balam minchupungei senkhat le Pharisee senkhat ngeiin Jisua an nôn theina rang abi rokin Sabathnin a mindam le a mindam loi an enrichika. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Jisua'n an mindonna a rieta, damloi kôma, “Inding inla moton tieng hin hong roh,” a tia, hanchu ânthoia ânding zoia. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Hanchu Jisua'n an kôma, “Ei Balamin Sabathnia, asa rangin mo, dûk mintong rangin mo? mi phal. Mi ringna min jôk rangin mo, minmang rangin mo?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>An rêngin a en titira, hanchu, a kôma, “Nu kut phar roh” a tia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tia; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">taksitakin a tia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn. </char></note>. A phara, a kut a dam pe zoia. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Hanchu, an taksi oka, Jisua chunga an tho thei rang lam an inkereng zoia.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ruoisi sômleinik a thangsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ma zora han Jisua chubai tho rangin muol chunga a sea, mahan, Pathien kôm jânkhovârin chubai a thoa. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Hanchu khuo a hong vârin chu a ruoisingei a koibûma, an lâia mi sômleinik a thanga, Tîrton, ai be ngei chu, <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simon (Peter, ai phuo) le a nâipa Andrew; Jacob le John, Philip le Bartholomew, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mathew le Thomas, Alpheaus nâipasal Jacob le Simon (zelot an ti) <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Jacob nâipasal Judas le a minsûrpu, Judas Iscariot ngei anni.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a minchuna le a mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Hanchu, Jisua le tîrtonngei hah muol chung renga an juong chuma, a ruoisi tamtak ngei leh mun inchamna an indinga, ha muna han mipui tamtak Judea ram murdi renga, Jerusalem renga, tuikhanglien pang khopuilienngei, Tyre le Sidon renga mingei an oma. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>A chongril rangâi rang le an natna ngei mindam ranga hong anni. Ratha saloi ngeiin dûk an mintong ngei khom an honga an dama. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>A sinthotheina a jôk sikin, mipui murdi'n ama tôn rangin an bôka, an rêngin an dam pak zoi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Satvurnangei le ngâisietna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Jisua'n, a ruoisingei a ena, a tia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Nangni ânriengngei chu satvur nin ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Pathien Rêngram nin ta ani sikin.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Nangni atûna vonchâmngei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">chu satvur nin ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Nin la khop rang sikin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Nangni atûna a chapngei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">chu satvur nin ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Nan lân nui rang sikin!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Miriem Nâipasal sika, mingeiin nangni an mumâka, nangni an henga, nangni an êroa, puoloingei nangni an ti tena, chu satvur nin ni. <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Rich 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Sin 7:52</ref></char></note>Ma anghan a hong tungin chu râisânin lâm roi. Invâna, râisânman luttak nin rangin dara a om sikin. Asikchu an richibulngei khomin dêipungei chunga ma angdên han an lei tho ngâi ani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>“Ania, nangni atûna ânchongngei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">nin chung ântak, nunkhohoi nin mang zoi sikin!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Nangni atûna akhopngei, nin chung ântak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Nan la châm rang sikin!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Nangni atûna ânnui ngei nin chung ântak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Inngûia nan la chap rang sikin!”<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Mi tinin nangni an minpâk tenan chu nin chung ântak, ha ang dêna han an richibulngei khomin dêipu dikloingei an lei manpâk ngâi ani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Râlngei lungkham rang roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Ke he ariet murdi'n, nan râlngei lungkham ungla, nangni mumâk ngei satna rang tho pe ngei roi. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>khomâk nangni sâm ngei satvur ungla, dûk nangni tho ngei chubai tho pe roi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Mîn na mâi a bêna anîn chu, kângkhat tieng khom do pe sa roh, mîn na kâncholi chung a lâka anîn chu asûnga khom pêk sa roh. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Mîn neinun nang an zonga anîn chu pêk roh, na ta an lâk khomin zong khâi no roh. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref></char></note> Nu chunga na nuomlam an tho angin mi chunga tho roh. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Mi lungkham nangni mu ngei vai lungkham nin mun te, inmo satvurna nan man ranga? mi nunsiengeii luo anni lungkham amu ngei chu anni khomin an lungkham ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Nin chunga sin sa tho ngei vai chunga sin sa nin thoa aninte inmo satvurna nin man ranga? Mi nunsiengeiin luo ha anga han chu an tho ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Man nôk ranga na sabei ngei kôma vai ne pêka aninte, inmo satvurna na man ranga? Mi nunsiengeiin luo, abipui man nôkna rangin chu, mi nunsiengei kôma an pêk ngâi! <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Ni thei no nih! Na râlngei lungkham inla, an satna rang sin pe ngei roh, ite man nôk rangin sabei loiin mintâng ngei roh. Hanchu, râisânman alien man nan ta, Ânchungtak Pathien nâingei nîng nin tih. Ama chu râisânna chang riet loi ngei le mi nunsiengei a lungkham ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Nin pa'n mi a lungkham angin nangni khomin lungkham roi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mi chungroi jêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Midang jêk no ungla, Pathien'n nangni jêk no nih. Midang dem no ungla, Pathien'n nangni dem no nih. Mi ngâidam ungla, Pathien'n nangni ngâidam a tih. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Pêk ungla, hanchu, Pathien'n nangni pêng a tih, mintena sa, namdên êt, le inîkin, min liemin, nin kuta akeng theidôrin nangni pêng a tih. Mi nin minte pena nanâka han Pathien'n nangni minte pênah a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisua'n hi chongmintêk hih a rila, “Mitcho inkhatin mitcho adang ruoi thei mak; a ruoia anîn chu an ruonin khursodopa tâk an tih. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Joh 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note> Minchupu nêkin ânchûpu lien uol maka, han, ânchupu khom a zoi tikin chu minchupu ang a tih. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Ithomo, ni mita thingbong a om mindon bak loia, na lâibungpa mita ronok a om hah ne en? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Inmo ni mita thingbong mu loiin, na lâibungpa kôma, ni mita ronok nang lei kêl pe rong ni ti thei ranga? Asarotholngei, Ni mita thingbong kêl bak inla, hanchu, na lâibungpa mita ronok mu minthâr thei ni tih.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thingkung le amara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Thingkung adamin mara saloi inra maka, thingkung damloiin mara sa inra ngâi mak. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12:33</ref></char></note> Thingkung tin an mara chita ei riet; riling rânga theichang pot ngâi mak chea, riling ranga grape pot ngâi mak che. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref></char></note>Mi sân chu a mulung sûnga neinun sa a kelsuoa, mi nunsien chu a mulung sûnga neinun saloi a kelsuo ngâi, mulung sûnga asip hah kêng bâiin a misîrsuok ngâi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">In sin inik ngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Ithomo ko chongbe jôm loia, Pumapa, Pumapa, mi nan ti? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Tukhom ko kôma honga, ko chong rangâia ko chongjôm chu imo ai ang nangni ril ki tih. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Ha mi hah chu a in sin lungpui chunga a lungphûm inthûk taka phun ang hah ani. Tuilienin a suka, innîk maka, adet ngita sin ani sikin. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Ania, tutukhom ke he rieta, ko chong jôm loi chu, lungphûm loia in sina, tuilienin asuka, achim kelena, ânphôi chit ang hah ani,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Rom râlmi ruoipu tîrlâm a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n mingei kôma chong a ril zoiin chu Capernaum'a khuoa a sea. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Rom râlmi ruoipu tîrlâm midit tak dam maka, a thi vavânga. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n thurchi a rieta anin chu a juonga a tîrlâm mindam ranga ngên rangin Juda Upangei a tîra. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Jisua kôma an honga, “Hi mi hih na san thei ruo ani. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Kin mingei lung a min khama, kin synagog khom mi sin pe ani” tiin an ngên rîta.<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Hanchu Jisua'n, anni ngei hah a jûi zoia. In a tung rangtôn chu, râlmi ruoipu'n a malngei a tîra, “O pu, intak takin hong no roh, ki ina mini pan rangin inhoi mu-ung. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Mapêna keima ngêt no kôma hong rang khomin inhoi mu-ung. Hê vai minchôi inla ki tîrlâm chu dam a tih. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Keikhom kenêka ulien chong nuoia om ki ni. Ko chong nuoia râlmingei an oma, inkhat kôm, ‘Se roh’ ki tiin a sea, ‘Hong roh,’ ki tiin a honga, Ki tîrlâm kôm, ‘Hih sin roh’ ki tiin a sin ngâi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n a rieta anin chu kamâm aom a tia, mipui ama jûi ngei a en titira, an kôma, “Nangni ki ril, hi angtaka taksônna hi chu Isrealngei lâia luo la mu ngâi mu-ung” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Thangthei ngeiin ruoipu in an hong kîrnôk inchu tîrlâm hah a damin an hong mu zoi.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n meithâi nâipasal a kaithoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Chomolte suole<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chomolte suole; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih miziek senkhat ngei chu</char><char style="fq" closed="false">nangtûka</char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn</char></note> chu Jisua, Nain khopuia a se zoia, a ruoisingei le mipuingeiin an jûia. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Hanchu, khopui mokot an tungin chu, mithi an hong rojôna. Ma athipa hah meithâinu nâikhât ania, male A khopuia mi tamtak ngei khom a kôma an oma. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Hanchu, Pumapa'n ama amûn chu inrieng amu oka, a kôm, “Chap no roh” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Hanchu ava nâia, a tolâi a tôna, a rojôn ngei an inngama, Jisua'n, “Ruotharte, inthoi roh nang ki ti,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Hanchu, mithi hah ânsung lita, a chonga. Hanchu, Jisua'n a nû kôm a pêk nôk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>An rêngin an chia, Pathien an minpâka, “Ei lâia dêipu roiinpui tak a juong inlanga, a mingei mi minjôk rangin Pathien a juong zoi,” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Hi Jisua thurchi hih Judea ram pumpuia le a kôlrevêla ânthang zit zoi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John ruoisingei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>John ruoisingeiin Jisua thurchi John an rila, hanchu a ruoisingei mi inik a koia, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Pumapa kôm a tîr ngeia, “a juong rang Messiah hah mo ni ni, mo midang kin la tûng rang mo?” itia rekel rangin. <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Hanchu, Jisua kôma an honga, “Baptispu John'n, a juong rangpu hah nini mo, midang kin la tûng rang mo? a ti” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Ma lâitaka han, Jisua'n, mi tamtak damloingei, an natnangei, ramkhori sûrngei a mindam ngeia, mitchongei mit a minvâr pea. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref></char></note>Hanchu, John ruoisingei kôma, “Se nôk ungla, John kôma, nin mu ngei le nin riet ngei hah va ril roi, mitchongeiin an mu theia, kholrangei an lôn thei zoi, aphârngei an inthienga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">inthienga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">5:12 en roh</char></note>, kuorsetngei kuor avâra, mithingei aringin an inthoi nôka, inriengngei kôma Thurchi Sa misîr ani zoi. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Iem zoiloina nei loi ngei chu satvur anni,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>John ruoisingei an se zoiin chu, Jisua'n John chungroi mipuingei kôma a misîra. “A kôma ramchâra nin se lâia han imo mu rangin nin sabei? phâivuon ai sêm sûl innîk ngei mo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Imo a en ranga nin se? Puon innêm insil mi mo? Ha anga insil ngâi ngei le ningnuoma lêng ngei chu rêng inah kêng an om ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Ni ril ta u, imo a en ranga nin se? Dêipu na? O, ani, Dêipu nêka lien uol nin mu zoi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char></note>John hih Pathien lekhabua, ‘Ki tîrton no motona na lampui sin rangin tîr ki tih,’ ai ti chu ani. <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Nangni ki ril John hih mi murdi lâia alientak chu ani. Ania, Pathien Rêngrama achîntak khom John nêkin chu a lien uol.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29,30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref></char>
    </note> John chongril mipuingeiin an rangâia, aliekin sumrusuong ngâi ngeiin Pathien chong an jôma, a kôma baptisma an changa. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Ania Balam minchupungei le phariseengeiin chu anta ranga Pathien mintuo an henga, John baptisma khom chang mak ngei.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Jisua'n, “Atûnlâi ruolthoitharngei hih imo an ang? Ilemo ki mintêk rang ani zoi? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Nâipangngei bazar muna insunga, senkhatin inneina berlem nangni kin tum pea, lâm mak cheia, chûlna la kin tho khomin chap mak cheia, itia in hêt inlôm angha anni. <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Baptispu John a juonga, bungêiin uain khom nêk maka, ramkhori kêng nin tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Miriem Nâipasal a juonga, a sâkin a nêka, rolruokpa, sumrusuongpungei le mi nunsiengei malpa nin tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>A modôm ngei rangin chu, Pathien vârna, chongdik minlangna ani” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pharisee Simon ina Jisua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Pharisee inkhatin Jisua bu nêk rangin a siela, Jisua a sea, bu nêk rangin ânsunga. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37,38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Joh 12:3</ref></char></note> Ma khopuia han nupang inkhat nunsie a oma. Jisua Pharisee ina bu a nêk iti a rietin chu, sariek mirimhoi alabastar bilôr a hongchôia. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Jisua nûktieng a ke bula ândinga, a chapa, a mitrithîn a kengei a mindûi pea. A samin a kengei a hûia, a ke a tuma, sariek mirimhoi a buoka. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Pharisee han a mulungrîlin, “Hi mi hih dêipu dik anîn chu, a tônnu, nupang saloi ani tie hih riet a tih” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Simon, nang ril rang ke nei” a tia. Simon'n, “O, Minchupu ni ril roh” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Mi inikin lâkâi pêk ngâipu kôm sumdâr an intânga, inkhatin razaranga, inkhatin sômranga. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>An thuon theiloi sikin an ruonin a ngâidam ngeia, a tu han mo lungkham uol nih?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simon'n a thuona, “Ki iem lamin chu a ngâidam tam uolpu hah” a tia, Jisua'n, “Ni ti mindik” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Male chu, nupangnu tieng mâi athaka, Simon kôma, “Hi nupangnu hih nu mu mo? Ni ina ko honga, ka ke rusûkna rang tui ni pêk mak chea, ama'n chu a mit rithîn ke kengei a rusûka, a samin a hûi minhula, <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>ni tumin ni lei don mak che, ama chu ko hong renga ka kengei a tum bâng mak. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Olive sariek ku lua buok mak chea, ama'n chu ka kengei sariek a pol minzo zita. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Masikin nang ki ril, lungkhamna lien a minlang han a nunsiena tamtak ngei hah ngâidam ani zoi, iti a minthâr. Masikin, tukhom ngâidamna chînin chu lungkhamna chîn a minlang” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Male, Jisua'n nupangnu kôma, “Ni sietnangei ngâidam ani zoi” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>A kôma insung ngeiin, Hi anga nunsie ngei tena ngâidam thei hih tumo ai ni? anin tia. <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Ania, Jisua'n nupangnu kôma, “Na taksônnân nang a sanminjôk zoi, rathanngam takin se ta roh” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua jûi nupang senkhatngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Hanchu, môrkhat suole chu, Jisua'n Galilee ram khopuingei le khuongei nâma Pathien Rêngram Thurchi Sa misîrin a chaia. Ruoisi sômleinik ngeiin an jûia. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2,3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mat 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mk 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luk 23:49</ref></char></note> Nupang senkhat ramkhori sûr renga an natnangeia a dam, Mary Magdalene, a sûng renga ramkhori sari a rujûlpai pe, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Herod office'a sin milien Chuza lômnu Joanna ngei, Susanna ngei, le midang nupang tamtak ngeiin an jûi saa. Hi mingei hin an sumin Jisua le a ruoisingei an san ngei ngâi ani.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sachi rethepu chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Khopui ankhat renga adanga mipuingei Jisua kôm an hong intûpkhôma, Jisua'n chongmintêkin a ril ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>Mi inkhat a bu rît rangin a loilâia a sea. Sachi a rethea, senkhat lampui kôla achula, vangeiin an sâk ripa. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Senkhat lungpherpha pil chunga achula, a hong mônga, pil an zit loi sikin a rôp nôk ripa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Senkhat chu riling kâra achula, ahong thuora, rilingin adîp thata. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Senkhat chu pil sana achula, a hong insôna, abâk raza chitin an hong inra zoi. Hanchu hi chongngei hih a rila, Jisua'n, Kuor nin dônin chu rangâi roi, a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chongmintêk mangna abi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>A ruoisingeiin hi chongmintêk omtie, Jisua an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Jisua'n, “Pathien Rêngram chong inthup riettheina nin kôma ipêk ani. Ania midangngei rangin chu, an ena an mu loina rang le an rangâia an rietminthâr loina rangin, chongmintêk vaiin misîr pe rang ani” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n sachi rethepu chongmintêk a rilminthâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Chongmintêk omtie chu hi anghin ani; Sachi chu Pathien chong ani. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Sachi lampui kôla chul chu, chong chu an rieta, ania, an iem loina rang le minringa an om loina rangin Soitanin an chong riet hah an mulungrîl renga a lâk pe ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Lung chung pila chul chu, an chong riet râisân takin an poma, nikhomrese, an nia han rujung inthuk nei loiin, an chunga minsinna a hongtung tena chu an inlet nôk ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Riling kâra chul chu, chong an rieta, aniatachu, hi ringnun hoiinhâina le inchongna ngei hin lungkâng a pêka, adîpa, amara reng min phâk ngâi mak. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Pil sana chul chu, chong an riet hah mulungrîla asadimin an dara, an jôma, an inra mâka dier ngei hah anni” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bêl nuoia châti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mk 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11:33</ref></char>
    </note> Tutên châti mochokin bêl nuoia dar ngâi mak ngei, jâlmun nuoia khom dar ngâi mak ngei. A lût murdi'n an mu theina rangin a darna muna kêng an dar ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12:2</ref></char></note> Ânthup murdi khom tâng minsuok nîng a ta, ihîpa om murdi khom avâra la minlangsuok nîng atih. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref></char></note> “Singthei roi, inmo nin rangâi, asikchu, a dônngei chu bôkpe sa nîng a ta, a dônloi chu a dôn vieta ai mindon te ha khom la lâk pe rip an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua nû le lâibungngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Hanchu, a nû le a lâibungngei Jisua kôma an honga, ania mipui sikin a kôma tung thei mak ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Mi inkhatin, “Na nû le na lâibungngeiin nang mu nuomin pêntieng an inding” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n an kôma, “Ka nû le ka lâibungngei chu Pathien chong rangâia a jômngei hih anni” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n phâivuopui a ngôna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Sûnkhat chu Jisua le a ruoisingei rukuonga an chuonga, “Dîl râl tieng son lenkân rei u” a tia, hanchu an inphêta. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Hanchu an se lâiin, Jisua chu a ina. Inningloiin phâivuopui a hong thoa, an rukuong tuiin a sip vavânga, rolo innîkin an oma. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Hanchu, ruoisingei Jisua kôma an sea, an kaithoia, “Minchupu, Minchupu! Kin thi suo rang kêng ani zoi” an tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Hanchu, Jisua ânthoia, Phâivuopui le tuidârinsok hah chong a pêka, an dâiruom zoia. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Hanchu, a ruoisingei kôma, “Khonmo, nan taksônna a om?” a tipe ngeia. Kamâmin an chia, Khoi anga miriem mo hi? Phâivuopui le tuidârinsokngei khom chong a pêka a chong an ijôm hi, anin tia.<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ramkhori sûr a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Hanchu Jisua le a ruoisingei hah Galilee dîl râl, Gerasa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gerasa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hi miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gadara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn (Mat 8:28 en roh); adangngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gergesa.</char></note> ram an tunga. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Jisua'n tuipânga a lôn lehan, khopui renga mi inkhat, ramkhori sûr ân tongpuia. Ha mi hah zora sôttak renga, dierboiin, ina khom om ngâi loiin thâna lei om ngâi ania. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Jisua a mûn chu ânieka, a ke bula ânboka, ânring takin, Jisua Pathien Ânchungtak Nâipasal, imo ni lo rang ni ti? Dûk ni mintong no roh, tiin a ngêna. <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Jisua'n ratha innim hah chong a pêk sika ma angtaka ai ti ani. Vêl tamtak an sûra, lung ina an khum ngâia, a kut le a ke zingjirûiin an khita chu a potsata, ramkhori han ramchâr tieng han a rujûl ngâi ani. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Jisua'n, “Imo ni riming?” tiin a rekela, “Ki riming chu, Mob” tiin a thuona, a sûnga ramkhori tamtak an lût sikin. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Hanchu, ramkhoringei han, khurmongboia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Khurmongboi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ramkhoringei hah pil nuoi inthûktaka han azoina taka dûktongna atung mâka chu khumin om an tih tiin mindon ani.</char></note> tîr loina rangin Jisua an ngêna.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Hanchu, ha muol panga han vok pâl sâk rokin an oma, ramkhoringeiin ha vokngei sûnga lût rangin Jisua an ngêna, a phalpe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Mipa sûng renga an jôka, vokngei sûnga an lût zoia. Rôlsôr dîl rakhama an tâna, tuia an tâka an thi let zoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Hanchu, vok avâipungei han neinun omtie an rietin chu, an sea khopuia le loia mingei an va ril ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Hanchu, neinun omtie en rangin mingei an suoka, Jisua kôm an hongin chu, ramkhori sûrpu hah, puon silin, ruthuok kipin Jisua ke bula insungin an mua, an rêngin an chia. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Hanchu, amu nâmin a dam tie mingei kôma an rila, <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Ha Gerasa rama mingei han an chi sikin Jisua hah an kôm renga rot rangin an ngêna, hanchu Jisua rukuonga a chuonga a mâk ngei zoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Ramkhori a sûng renga a jôka a dampu han, Jisua kôm nang jûi ki tih, a tia. <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>Hanniresea, Jisua'n, “Ni ina senla, nu chunga Pathien sintho tie va misîr roh” a tipea. Hanchu, a sea, khopui sûng pumpuia a chunga Jisua sintho tie hah a misîr zoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jairus nâinupang le nupang hulloi a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Hanchu, Jisua dîl râl tieng a hongtung nôkin chu, mipuingei ama lei ngak sikin an lei modôma. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Ha khuoa synagog ruoipu Jairus a honga, Jisua ke bula ânboka, a ina se rangin a ngêna. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>A nâikhât nâinupang, kum sômleinik mi, a thi vavâng sikin. Hanchu, Jisua a sên chu mipuingeiin an ûmhura.<verse eid="LUK 8:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Nupang inkhat kum sômleinik piel, hulloi inrik a oma, ai dôn murdi doctora a thâm let zoia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:43: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ai dôn murdi doctora atham let zoi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih dôn mak ngei</char></note> tute lakin mindam thei mak ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Mipuingei kâra Jisua nûktieng a honga, a puonmor a tôna, harenghan a dam kelena. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Jisua'n, “Tumo ni tôn?” a tia. Kei chu ni mu-ung an ti chita. Hanchu Peter'n a kôma, “Minchupu, hi dôra mipuiin nang an uop hite” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Ania, Jisua'n “tuminin chu min tôn, Keima renga sinthotheina ajôk” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Nupangnu ani ti rietsuok ani zoi, ti ânriet tena chu, innîk pumin mipuingei makunga, Jisua ke bula inbokin, a tôna harenghan a dam kelen roi hah misîr zoi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n a kôma, “Ka nâinupang, na taksônnân nang a mindam zoi, rathanngam takin se ta roh” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Jisua'n ha a ti lâitakin, ruoipu in renga thangthei a honga, Jairus kôma, “Na nâinupang a thi zoi, Minchupu jêl khâi no roh” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Jisua'n a rieta, Jairus kôma, “Chino roh, iem ngit roh, dam a tih,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>In ava tungin chu Peter, John, Jacob, nâite nû le pa pêna chu tute dang a kôma lût phal maka. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Hataka om murdi nâite chûlin an chapa, Jisua'n, “Chap no roi, athi ni mak, a in kêng” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Hanchu, nâite hah a thi ani iti an riet sikin an munuisana. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n a kut a sûra, “Ka nâite, hong inthoi roh” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Hanchu, a ringna a juong kîra, harenghan a hon thoia, Jisua'n “sâk rang imokhat pêk roi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>A nû le a pa'n kamâm om an ti tataka; nikhomrese, Jisua'n chu a sintho hah tute ril loi rangin chong a pêka zoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ruoisi sômleinik ngei a tîrsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Jisua'n ruoisi sômleinik ngei hah a koibûma, an kôma, ramkhori rujûlpai theina le natnangei mindam theinangei le rachamneina a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Male chu, Pathien Rêngram thurchi misîr rang le damloingei mindam rangin a tîrsuok ngei zoia.<verse eid="LUK 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Hanchu, an kôma, “Khuolchaina rangin ite chôi no roi, sunrol mo, cholite mo, sum mo, bu mo, kancholi insak mo,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>“Nangni an lei modômna ina han, om tit ungla, ma khopui nin mâk nôk mâka chu. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10:4-11</ref></char></note>Mi'n nangni an lei modôm nônchu, anni rilnân nin kea pildi hah khôngpai roi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Hanchu rouisingei an sea, muntina thurchisa misîrin khuotina an chaia, damloingei an mindam tir zoi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod mulungjîngna roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7,8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9:19</ref></char>
    </note>Hanchu Galilee rama roijêkpu, Herod'n neinun omtie ngei a rieta anîn chu a mulung a jînga, senkhatin Baptispu John kêng a ring nôk an tipe sikin, <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Senkhatin Elijah kêng a juong inlâr nôk zoi, an ti, senkhatin tienlâia dêipu tumakhat kêng a ring nôk zoi an tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Herod'n John lu laka ka tan zoia, hi ang taka thurchi ki riet hih tumo ai ni? tiin Jisua mu rangin a nuoma.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi isâng rangnga a vâina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Hanchu, tîrton sômleinik ngei an hongkîr nôkin chu an sin va tho Jisua an rila. Hanchu, a kôm a tuong ngeia, Bethsaida khopuia atheiin a sepui ngei zoi. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Mipuiin an rietin chu an jûia. A modôm ngeia, Pathien Rêngram thurchi a misîr pe ngeia, mindam anâng ngei kai chu a mindam ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Hanchu, kholoi ahong nîn chu, ruoisi sômleinik ngei an honga, a kôma, “Mipui ngei hih min se ngei ta roh, khopui sûnga le akôlrevêla bu le riamun an man theina rangin, ei omna lak mun inthim kêng ani” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Ania Jisua'n an kôma, “Nangnin sâkruo pêk ngei roi” a tipe ngeia. “Annin, vâipôl tâp rangnga le nga inik mang kêng kin nei. <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Hi dôra pasal isâng rangnga sâk rang hih a rochôk rangin kin se rang mini?” tiin an thuona. Hanchu, Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôma, “Mipui hi sômranga ngân abukin min sung ngei roi,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Hanchu, a ruoisingeiin a he bê angin mipui ngei hah an minsung ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n vâipôl rangnga le nga inik hah a lâka, invân tieng a tanga, Pathien kôm râisânchong a rila, a khoia, hanchu mipui ngei sem rangin a ruoisingei a pêka. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Hanchu, anrêngin an khop dodôrin an sâk suonûkin, an sâk minieng, tâidôn sômleinik ruoisingeiin an rût minsip ani.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n Jisua chungroi a phuong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mk 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Sûnkhat chu, Jisua'n atheiin chubai a thoa, a ruoisingei an honga, an kôma, “Mipuingeiin tumo min ti ngâi?” tiin a rekela. <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char></note> “Senkhatin, ‘Baptispu John’ senkhatin ‘Elijah,’ senkhatin tienlâia dêipu tumakhat, a juong nôk nang an ti ngâi,” tiin an thuona. <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Joh 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char></note> Hanchu, “nangnin te tumo minin ti?” tiin a rekel ngeia. Peter'n, “Messiah Pathien na ni” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n a tuong rang le a thi rang roi a ril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mk 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n hi chong hih tute kôma misîr tet loi rangin chong a be ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>An kôma, “Miriem Nâipasal hi upangei, Ochaisingei, Balam minchupungeiin hengpai an ta, dengmanthei ok an tih. That an ta, ania, sûnthum suole chu a ringin inthoi nôk a tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char></note> Hanchu an rênga kôma, “Tutu, ni jûi a nuoma anîn chu ama in mingilin, anîngtin a khros ruputin ni jûi rese. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joh 12:25</ref></char></note>Tutu, a ringna minjôk a nuom kaiin chu machân a ta, ania, keima sika a ringna machân kaiin ring an tih. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Mîn rammuol hih apumin nei senla, a theiin inmangin mo, machânin mo om ta senla ata rangin imo ânlap! <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Mîn keima le ka thurchi inzakpui chu, Miriem Nâipasal khomin, a roiipuina leh Pa roiinpuina leh vântîrton inthieng ngei leh a juong tikin inzakpui a tih. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Hitaka senkhat ngei hin Pathien rêngram an mu mâka chu thi noni ngei iti riettit roi” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mêl inthûlna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mk 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28-35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note> Hi chong a misîr zoia, hapta khat suole chu, Jisua'n Peter, John le Jacob ngei hah muol chunga chubai tho rangin a tuong ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Hanchu, chubai a tho lâitakin a mâi ânthûla, a mêl le a puonsilngei khom avâr intêrrakin a oma. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Harenghan mi inik an juong oma, an chongpuia, Moses le Elijah an ni. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Invân roiinpuinân an juong inlâra, Pathien bôkna len ranga, Jerusalema Jisua thi rang tie an misîra. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Peter le a champui ngei chu an inphara, an inthoiin chu Jisua roiinpuina le a kôma mi inik inding ngei an mua. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Mingei han Jisua an mak rangtôn chu, Peter'n a kôma, “Hitaka om hi eita rangin asa, puon in inthum nata rang inkhat, Moses rang inkhat le Elijah rang inkhat sin kin tih” a tia. (ha a chong ti hah asadimin riet minthâr mak) <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>A la chong lâitakin sûmin a juong minlia, an chunga sûmin a juong mukhûn chu ruoisingeiin an chia. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note> Sûm renga rôlin, “Ama hih ka Nâipasal ka thangsuok chu ani, a chong rangâi roi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Rôl amongin chu, Jisua vai a om zoia. ruoisingei han an neinun mu tute ril loiin an ip tita.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n ramkhori sûr nâipang a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mk 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Anangtûka Jisua le ruoisi inthum ngei hah muol chung renga an juong chumin chu mipui tamtak ngeiin an lei dona. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Hanchu, mipuingei lâia mi inkhatin, “Minchupu, ka nâipasal, ke neisun hi en ta,” tia ngênin ân-ieka. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>“Ramkhorin a sûra, a minleta, a cherhuon asuoka, a minna, inningloiin a min ieka, a vôr raka darnân a min se ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>A rujûlpai rangin nu ruoisingei ke ngên ngei lakin thei mak ngeia” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Jisua'n, “Iemna neiloi le mi puoloingei o! Iten sôt mo nin kôma omin nangni ko donsûi ranga? Na nâipasal hah hin hong tuong roh” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Hanchu nâipang hah a hongin chu, ramkhori han a nîka pila inngil rakin a vôra. Jisua'n ramkhori hah chong a pêka, nâipang hah a mindama, a pa kôma a pêk zoi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Pathien sinthotheina roiinpui hah mipui ngei murdi'n an kamâm ok ani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jisua'n a thi rang roi a misîr nôkna</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mipui ngeiin Jisua sinthongei an kamâm lâiin, a ruoisingei kôma, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Nangni ki ril rang hih mingil no roi, Miriem Nâipasal hih miriemngei kôma ipêk nîng a tih” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Ania, ruoisingei lakin ai ti omtie hah rietthei mak ngeia. An riet thei loina ranga chong inthup ania, ama laka an chi sikin rekel ngam mak ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tumo a lientak?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hanchu, ruoisingei han ei lâia tumo a lien rang tak tiin inkhalna an neia. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Jisua'n an mindonna a rieta, nâipangte a kaia, a kôla a mindinga. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Joh 13:20</ref></char></note> An kôma, “Tutu, hi nâipangte ki riminga modôm chu, keima ni modôm ani; tutu keima ni modôm chu ni tîrpu modôm ani. Nin lâia a chintak hi a lientak ani,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nangni chakal loi chu nan tienga kop ani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mk 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>John'n, “Minchupu, mi inkhatin ni rimingin, ramkhori a rujûlpaia, ei pâla mi ani loi sikin, kan khap” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Jisua'n a kôma le adangngei kôma, “Khap no roi nangni chakal loi chu nin tienga kop ani” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samari khopui inkhata Jisua an hengpai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Jisua invâna a kal rang ni a hong nâia anîn chu, Jerusalema se rangin a mulungin a bôka, a se kelen zoi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>A motona thangthei a tîra, ata ranga neinuntin lei cherêl rangin Samari khuo inkhata an lûta. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Ania, Jerusalema se anni iti an rietminthâr sikin lei modôm mak ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Rêng 1:9-16</ref></char></note> Hanchu, ruoisi Jacob le John'n an rietin chu a kôma, “Pumapa, anni ngei minmangna rangin Elijah angin invân renga mei koisumna rangin mini nuom mo?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhatngei chu an bôk </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Elijah a tho angin.</char></note> an tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhatngeiin an bôk </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“kho anga ratha ta mo nin ni nangnin riet mak chei; asikchu Miriem Nâpasal chu munisi ringna minboi ranga juong nimaka; ania sanminring ranga juong kêng ani,” a tia.</char></note> Jisua an tieng ânheia, a ngo ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Male Jisua le a ruoisingei chu khuo danga an se zoi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua la jûi rang ngei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-22">Mat 9:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Hanchu, lampuia an lôn lâiin, mi inkhatin Jisua kôma, “Na sêna muntina nang jûi ki tih” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Sialngei'n kuo an dôna, vangeiin rubu an dôna, ania, Miriem Nâipasal chu a lu minngamna rang luo mun dôn mak” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 9:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Hanchu midang kôma, “Ni jûi roh” a tipea. Ania ha mi han, “Pumapa, sêng ka ta, ka pa la phûm bak ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “A thi ngeiin an mithi champui ngei phûm rese ngei, nang chu sênla, Pathien Rêngram thurchi va misîr roh” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Rêng 19:20</ref></char></note> Mi dangin a kôma, “Pumapa, nang jûi ki tih, ania, ki inmingei chong hoiin ni manthân bak roh” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Hanchu Jisua'n a kôma, “Tutu, âl kaina taka kut bânga, nûk tienga en chu, Pathien Rêngrama ranga mi nithei mak” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n sômsarileinik ngei a tîrna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Masuole chu, Pumapa'n, midang sômsarileinik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sômsaileinik; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sômsari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn</char></note> a thanga, abop abopin an sena rang khopuitina le muntina, ama motona a tîra. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mat 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref></char></note> An kôma, “Bu ât rang atama, ania a mintûp ranga sin rang mi an tôm, Masikin, a bu mintûp ranga sintho rang mi tîr rangin bu pumapa kôm ngên roi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat 10:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Se roi! Melang lâia belrite om anga han nangni ki tîr ani. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mk 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk 9:3-5</ref></char></note>Sumkok mo, cholite mo, kekok mo, chôi no roi; lampuia khom tute chibai no roi. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>In nin lûtna kipa, ‘Hi ina hin rathanngamna om rese’ ti bak roi. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Rathanngamna midit mi an oma anîn chu nin rathanngamna chibai hah an chunga om a tih; an om nôn chu nin chibai hah lâk kîr nôk roi. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref></char></note>Nin tungna ina han omtit ungla, nangni an pêk murdi sâk ungla, nêk roi, sinthopu chu lo pêk rang ani sikin. In tin lôrdul no roi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Khopui nin lûta nangni an modôma anîn chu, nangni an pêk kai chu sâk roi. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Ma khuoa damloi ngei mindam ungla, an kôma, ‘Pathien Rêngram nin kôma ajuong nâi zoi’ tipe ngei roi. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10,11: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Sin 13:51</ref></char></note> Khopui nin lûtna nâm nangni an modôm nôn chu, lampuia jôkpai ungla, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>nin khopuia pildi, kin kea kop tena khom nin chunga kin khôngthâk nôk vang ania, ‘Pathien Rêngram chu nin kôm ajuong nâi zoi!’ tipe ngei roi, a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aph 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref></char></note> Nangni ki ril, Pathien Roijêk Nikhuo tika chu, ma khopuingei tuong rang nêkin chu, Sodom chu ajâi om uol atih!”<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Iemloi khuongei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Ezek 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joel 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amos 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zak 9:2-4</ref></char>
    </note>“Korazin, na chungroi arik bah na! Bethsaida, khom na chung roi arik bah na! Nangnia sininkhêl itho ngei hah Tyre le Sydon khuoa tho nisenla chu, thoila puon insilin, pildi inpolin an sietnangei insîr an tih. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Roijêk Nîn chu nin tuong rang nêkin Tyre le Sydon chu ajâi om uol an tih. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14:13-15</ref></char></note>Nangma Capernaum khom, nethenin invân idênin nên pâk rang mini? Dûkmuna kêng vôrpai na ni rang.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Joh 13:20</ref></char>
    </note> Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôma, “Tutu nin chong rangâi chu ko chong rangâi ani, tutu nangni heng chu ni heng ani, tutu ni heng chu ni tîrpu heng ani,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sômsarileinik ngei hongkîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Hanchu, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">72; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">70 an dô </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(arachang 1 na en roh) </char></note> sômsarileinik ngei hah râisân takin an hong kîra, “Pumapa, ni rimingin ramkhoringei tena kin chong an jôm” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Jisua'n a thuon ngeia, “Soitan, invân renga kôlinlek anga juong tâk ku mu,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Lap 91:13</ref></char></note> An kôma, “Rangâi roi, murûlngei le âinuvet chunga lôn theina le râlngei roineina chunga rachamneina nangni ke pêk, itên nangni minna thei noni ngei,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>“Ania ramkhoringeiin nin chong an jôm sikin nan râiminsân no roia, Invâna nin riming mizieka a om sikin nan râiminsân roi” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua râisânna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ma zora han Jisua Ratha Inthiengin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ratha Inthiengin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ratha han; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">an tia senkhat nôk chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a ratha han </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn.</char></note> a sipa, “O Pa, invân le pilchung Pumapa, mivâr, mi theithiem ngei kôma ni ip, mi inmôlngei kôma nu phuong sikin nang ki minpâk. Ani, O Pa, maha nu lungdo le na nuomlam tak ani,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Joh 3:35</ref>; </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 10:15">Joh 10:15</ref></char></note>Ka Pa'n neinun murdi ni pêk zoi. Tutên, Pa ti loiin chu Nâipasal riet mak. Tutên Nâipasal ti loiin chu Pa khom riet mak, Nâipasalin ânphuongna ngei tiloiin chu. <verse eid="LUK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Hanchu, Jisua ruoisingei tieng ân heia, inrûkten, “Hi ngei nin mu hih idôra mi satvur mo nin ni! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Dêipungei, rêngngei tamtakin nin mu ngei hih mu rang an nuoma chuh mu mak ngei, nin iriet ngei a riet an nuoma chuh riet mak ngei,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samari misa Chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref></char>
    </note> Balam minchupu inkhat Jisua minvak rangin a honga, a kôma, “Minchupu, Kumtuong ringna ka manna rangin imo ki sin rang?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Lekhabu'n imo ati? Imo no pore ngâi?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Bal 6:5</ref>; </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Och 19:18</ref></char></note>Hanchu ama'n, “Pumapa na Pathien chu, nu mulung murdi'n, ni ringna murdi'n, na râtna murdi'n ni mindonna murdi'n lungkham roh. Nangma lung nên kham anghan nu bungmingei lungkham roh ati,” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:5">Bal 18:5</ref></char></note>Jisua'n a kôma, “Ni ti mindik, ha angtak han thô inla, ring ni tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Hannisenla, Balam minchupu hah theiintum nuomin, Jisua kôma, “Tumo ku bungngei?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n a thuona, “Hanchu voikhat, mi inkhat Jerusalem renga Jericho'a a sea, inru ngei a tonga, an jêmpola, an tôk bita, a thi vângin an mâk raka. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Hanchu ha lampuia han ochai inkhat a juong sea, ha mi hah a mûn chu lam dang tieng a piela. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Ma ang nanâk han, Levi mi a juonga, a ena, hanchu lamsîr tieng a piela. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33,34: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Rich 28:15</ref></char></note>Hanchu, Samari mi inkhat han ha lampuia lônin a honga, a mûn chu lungkham a mua. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>A kôm ava pana, a sâbengei sariek le uain a buoka, a thom pea, a sakuording chunga a minchuonga, khuol tung ina a tuonga, a donsûi zoia. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>A nangtûka chu, sum dârnik a kelsuoa, khuol tung in enkolpu a pêka, ‘Lei donsûi inla,’ a chunga na thâm kai chu ko hong kîr nôk tika nang thuon ki tih” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Jisua'n, a kôma, “Inthum ngei lâia han atu tak ha mo inru ngei tongpu bungmi ani ranga ni iem?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Balam minchupu han a kôma, “inriengmupu tak hah” tiin a thuona. Jisua'n, “Sênla, nang khom ha ang tak han tho roh,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Martha le Mary a pan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38,39: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Joh 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hanchu, Jisua le a ruoisingei an khuol se nân, khuo inkhata an lûta, nupang a riming Martha a ina a modôm ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>A juorpuinu riming chu Mary ani, ama han Pumapa ke bula insungin, a chongril a rangâia. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Ania, Martha chu sinthôn ânpol oka, a honga, “Pumapa, kênzirpui nûn ke theivaia sintho ranga ni mâkrak hih ni mindon pe mak che mo hi?” ni hong san rangin tipe roh! a tia. <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Pumapa'n amanu kôma, “Martha, Martha, neinun tamtak ni mindon sika nênjêl kêng. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Inkhat vai kêng ai nâng, Mary hin neinun dik a thanga, a kôm renga isut nôk rang ni khâi mak,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n chubai tho a minchûna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Sûnkhat chu Jisua'n, mun inkhata chubai a thoa. A zoiin chu, a ruoisi inkhatin, “Pumapa, John'n a ruoisingei chubai tho a minchu ngei ngâi angin keini khom chubai tho mi minchu roh,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n an kôma, “Chubai nin thoa anîn chu hi ang hin ti roi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Kin Pa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Ni riming inthieng mirit om rese;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Ne Rêngram juong tung rese.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Nîngtin kin sâk rang anâng ngei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kin sâk rang anâng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nangtûka kin sâk rang.</char></note> mi pêk roh.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Kin sietnangei mi ngâidam roh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Keini khomin, kin chunga saloi tho ngei kin ngâidam ngâi sikin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Minsinna intakna mi tuong no roh,’ ” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôma, “Tumakhatin, jânchima a malpa ina se senla, ‘Mal, vâipôl tâpthum ni lei sem roh. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Ka malpa khuola a honga, ite man sâk rang lak nei mu-unga!’” ti senla. <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>A malpan in sûng renga, “Ni hong jêl khâi no roh, inkhâr ka kal zoia, ka nâingei leh kin jâl kêng ani zoi. Inthoiin ite nang pêk thei khâi no ning!” ti ta senla. <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Hanchu, a mal ni nia, inthoiin nang a hong pêk no nâka, inzak loia ne ngênrît sikin inthoiin nu nuom dôr nang hong pêk a tih, a tia. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>“Masikin nangni ki ti, zong roi, ipêk nîng nin tih, rok roi man nin tih, tôk roi inkhâr mo-ong pe nîng nin tih. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Asikchu, tutu a zong kai chu ipêk nîng an ta, a rok kaiin chu man an ta, a tôk kai chu inkhâr mo-ong pe nîng an tih. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Nangni lâia pangei hin, nin nâingeiin ngâ nangni zong rese ngei, murûl pêk ung mo? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Nôn chu, ârtui nangni zong rese ngei, âinuvet pêk ung mo? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Nangni misaloi ngeiin luo, nin nâingei neinun sa pêkna chang nin rietin te, nin Pa invâna omin vângin chu a nâingei idôra mo Ratha Inthieng ai pêk ok rang na! a zongpu murdi chu” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mk 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n ramkhori chong theiloi inkhat a rujûlpaia, a jôk suole chu miriem chong theiloi hah a chong thei zoia. Mipuingei han an kamâm sabaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note>Ania, mi senkhatin chu, ramkhori rêngpa, Beelzebul kêng, rujûlpai theina ranak a pêk ani, an tia. <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref></char></note>Senkhatin chu ama min ôkna rangin, Pathien renga sininkhel sin rangin an tia. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Ania, Jisua'n an mindonna a rieta, masikin an kôma, “Kho ram khom insena anni le anni indoi kai chu ram an tih, insûngkuo khom anni le anni indoi kai chu inmang an tih. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Soitan rêngram khom pâl sinin anni le anni an indoiin te, inmo ânding ranga? Inmo, Beelzebulin rachamneina a pêka ramkhoringei a rujûlpai ngei ni nan ti thei,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Ma anga Beelzebul sika ku rujûlpai ngâi anin le, nin nûkjûi ngeiin tu sikin mo an rujûlpai ngâi? Anni han nin dikloi ani iti nangni an minthâr ani. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Hanchu, Pathien rachama ramkhoringei ka rujûlpai ngâi anin chu, Pathien Rêngram nin kôma ajuongtung tatak ani zoi a minthâr ani.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Mi râtin râlrovo kipa, a in a ngâkin chu, a neinuntin mojôkin a om ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Ania ama nêka rât uolin a hong doia, a menên chu, ân tûngna râlrovo nâm a lâk pea, a neinun ai lâk pe khom a sem minzar ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref></char></note> Tutu keima tienga kop loi kai chu midoi ania, tutu ni mintûp pui loi kai chu a chekminchâi ani.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ratha saloi hongkîrna roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>Ratha saloi hah, mi sûng renga a jôkpaia anîn chu, tui boina rama inngam mun rokin a chai titira, a man loi tena chu, “Ki ina kîrnôk ki tih” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>A hongkîr nôkin chu, in phiet min saia cherêl diem a mua. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Hanchu a se nôka, ratha saloi dang sari, ama nêka puoloi uol a hong tuonga, an lûta, an om ngâi. Masikin ma miriem omdân anûka hah chu a motona nêkin a siet uol ngâi.<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Râisâna dik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Jisua'n ha chong hah a misîr zoiin chu, mipui lâi renga nupang inkhat a hêta, “Nupang nang a vonga nang a donsûinu chu satvur ani,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Pathien chong rieta a jôm ngei chu satvur anni uol,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minsinna an zong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char>
    </note> Mipuingeiin an ûmhur lâiin Jisua'n, atûnlai mingei hih idôra siet mo anni zoi? Sininkhêl an zonga, hannisenla, Jonah minsinna pênna chu ite minsinna dang ipêk ni no nih. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Jon 3:4</ref></char></note> Nineveh, khuo mingei ranga dêipu Jonah minsinna ai ni anga han atûnlâi mingei rangin chu, Miriem Nâipasal hih minsinna nîng a tih.<verse eid="LUK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Rêng 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Rich 9:1-12</ref></char>
    </note> Roijêk Nîn chu Thang tienga Rêngnu Sheba lân ding a ta, atûnlâi mingei theiloimintum a tih. Rêng Solomon vârna rangâi rang pielin ram latak renga a hong sikin. Nangni ki ril Rêng Solomon nêka lien uol hin a om.<verse eid="LUK 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JON 3:5">Jon 3:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Roijêk Nîn chu Nineveh mingei khom hong inding an ta, theiloi nangni min tum an tih. Jonah chong a rila an sietna renga an insîr sikin. Nangni ki ril Jonah nêka lien uol hin a om, a tia.<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Takpuma vâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mk 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk 8:16</ref></char>
    </note> Tutên, châti mockokin, thupin bêl nuoia dar ngâi mak, a darna muna kêng an dar ngâi, mi a lût murdi'n avâr an mu theina rangin. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Nin mitngei hi nin takpuma meivâr ang ani. Nin mit avârin chu, nin takpum khom a vâr iema, nin mit a sieta anîn chu nin takpum khom a jîngkhap ani. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Masikin, singthei roi, nin vâr ajîng loina rangin. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Hanchu, châtiin, nangni ai êlminvâr iem ngâi anga han nin takpum abâk ajîngna boi riekin, nin pumin vâr iem a tih.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Pharisee le Balam minchupungei a ngonna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Hanchu, Jisua a chong zoiin chu, Pharisee inkhatin ama leh bu nêk rangin a siela, male a sea, bu nêk rangin ânsunga. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Pharisee han, Jisua kut rusûk loia khalâi a ot a mûn chu a kamâm oka. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Hanchu, Pumapa'n a kôma, “Nangni Phariseengei, kilât le bukhêng apêntieng nin minsâia, ania, nin sûng tieng chu huongna le sietna sip ani. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Mo ngei, apêntienga sinpu, Pathien'n asûng tieng khom ai sin nimak mo? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Ni kilât le bukhênga om hah inriengngei pêk inla hanchu, neinuntin inthieng let a tih.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Och 27:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Nangni Phariseengei nin chung ântak bah na! nin neinun manvâng, lêngmesêr, chimu murdi, sômakhat Pathien nin pêka, hannisenla, indikna le lungkhamna chu nin seleta, ha tak hah kêng nin sintum, adangngei khom selet uol loiin. <verse eid="LUK 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Nangni Phariseengei nin chung ântak bah na! Inkhom ina sukmun asa nin midita, bazar muna mingei nangni an jâ nin rangâi minluta. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Nin chung ântak bah na! Thân muruo sîntholoi mîn riet loia a chunga an lôn ang hah nin ni,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Hanchu, Balam minchupu lâia inkhatin, a kôma, “Minchupu, ma ni ti hah keini khom mi na êrona kêng” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Nangni, Balam minchupungei khom nin chung ântak, mi chunga pêl ântak, puok rik nan bânga, a pêlpui rangin chu nin kutmitin le luo tôn mak chei. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Nin chung ântak bah na! Nin richibul ngeiin an ithat dêipungei thân nin sinsiema. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Nin richibul ngeiin dêipungei an lei that hah nangnin khom nin pompui minennân an thânngei nin sinsiema. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Masikin, Pathien vârnân, Dêipungei le Thangtheingei tîr ka ta, senkhatngei that an ta, senkhatngei dûk mintong an tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Masikin rammuol insieng renga dêipungei an lei that sikin, atûnlâi mingei hih dûk mintong nîng an tih. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Aph 4:8</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Rich 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref></char></note> Abel an that renga Zakariah dênin, ama vâng chu mâichâm le Muninthieng kâra that ani. Nangni ki ti, masik piela han atûnlâi mingei dûk mintong nîng an tih. <verse eid="LUK 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Balam minchupungei khom nin chung ântak bah na! Rietna inkhâr in ongna chabi nin vonga, nangni lak lût no tunuia, a lût rang a nuomngei tena nin khapa.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n ha mun a mâkin chu, Balam minchupungei le Phariseengeiin an dema chong rekel tamtak an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Thuonna minchâi a neia sûr theina rangin an muruong chien ani.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Asarotholngei renga intûngna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mk 8:15</ref></char>
    </note>Mipui isâng tamtak, inkhat le inkhat insirpolin Jisua an bôma. Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôma, “Pharisee asarotholngei chol renga singthei roi. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref></char></note>Jâttin ihîpa om la phong nîng a tih, a ipa om khom la phuongsuok nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Masikin, ajînga nin ti ngei hah sûn khovâra lân phuong nîng a ta, khâltan sûnga kuor kunga nin ti ngei hah inchunga chuongin tânghâi la nîng a tih,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tumo a chiruo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>Ka malngei nangni ki ril, ei takpum that suonûka, ite mi lo thei khâiloi chu chi no roi. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Tumo nin chiruo nangni ril ki tih. Thi nûk khoma, dûkmuna nangni pai theina rachamnei ani sikin, Pathien chi roi, ani, nangni ki ti, Ama vai chi roi. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Invate rangnga poisa nikin an juor ngâi ni mak mo? Ania, Pathien'n chu inkhat te luo hah mingil ngâi mak. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Nin lu chunga nin samngei tena khom itelvar kêng. Masikin, chi no roi, invate tamtak nêkin nin lut uol.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista phuongna le hengpaina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Nangni ki ril, tutu lôko rieta ni thop kai chu, Miriem Nâipasal khomin Pathien vântîrtonngei makunga thop a tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Tutu lôko rieta ni hengpai kaichu, Miriem Nâipasal khomin vântîrtonngei makunga hengpai a tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mk 3:29</ref></char></note>Tutu Miriem Nâipasal rilsiet chu ngâidam nîng a ta, Ratha Inthieng rilsiet chu ngâidam nino nih.”<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11,12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mat 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mk 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Luk 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref></char>
    </note> “Hanchu, nin roi jêk rangin synagog mo, governor makunga mo, roijêkpungei makunga mo, nangni an tuong tikin, inmo ki thuon rang, imo ki ti rang, tiin nin mulung min jîng no roi. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Nin ti rang chu a zora tika Ratha Inthiengin nangni ril a tih.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amo aneipa chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mipui lâia mi inkhatin Jisua kôma, “Minchupu, Ka lâibungpa kôm, kin pa rochon mi mâk pe mi sem rangin tipe roh,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Mala, nangni inik chungroi jêk rang le nin rochon sem rangin tumo roineina mi pêk?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Hanchu, an rênga kôma, “Singthei roi, ôinangei murdi renga indîn thei roi, asikchu, rochon, neinangei hih miriem ringna abitak nimak, idôr khom nei resea,” a tipe ngei.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Male, Jisua'n hi chongmintêk hih a ril ngeia, “Mi aneipa inkhat hin a loia chimu tamtak a minvânga, <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Inmo ko tho rang ani zoi, o, ka bu le bâl darna rang dôn khâi mu-ung hi,” tiin a mindona. <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Hi anghin tho ki tih, ka sasier set ka ta, anêka lien uol sin ki tih, mahan ke neinun murdi dar ki tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Maleh, ka ratha kôma, “Ratha, kum tamtak rang neinun sa nu bûm zoi sikin, sâk inla nêk roh, ningbei riemin om roh tipe ki tih” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Ania, Pathien'n a kôma, “Amo, avien jân reng ni ringna aboi rang kêng ani zoi, hi neinun ni isuo ngei hih tuta rang tak mini?” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Hanchu Jisua'n, “Pathien tieng nei loia, eini ta rang vaia rochon a bûm chu ha anga han nîng a tih” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien iem roh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôma, masikin nangni ki ti, nin taksa sâk nêk rang, nin sil nin bom rang nin kâng mindoi no roi. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Sâk nêk rang nêkin ringna alut uol, silbom rang nêkin takpum alut uol. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Invatengei en ta u, chimu khom tu mak ngei, bu khom ât mak ngei, sasier khom nei mak ngei, hankhoma Pathien'n a vâia, vangei nêkin nin lut uol ok. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Tumo a kângdoi sika a ringna a min sôt thei uola?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a minsei thei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ânsôn insâng thei.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Ma ngeite luo nin tho thei loiin, imo neinun dang vângte nin kâng nin mindoi?<verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Rêng 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Rich 9:3-6</ref></char>
    </note> Ram pârngei en ta u, sin khom tho mak ngei, puon khom không mak ngei. Ania nangni ki ril, ma dôra anei, rêng Solomon luo han hi pârte hih phâk mak. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Pathien kêng loisûl puon minsil, sûl aviena oma nangtûka lungthua hâl rip rang. Nangni vâng chu, nangni minsil no ni mo? Nin taksônna achîn bah na!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Masikin nin sâk nin nêk rang mindonin nin kângmindoi no roi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Jentailngeiin ma ang roi chu an mindon ngâi. Nin Pa'n nin inâng chu a riet let. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Manêkin a Rêngram mindon bak ungla hanchu ha neinunngei ha chu nangni pêng a tih.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Invâna neina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Chi no roi, lôm achînte ngei, nin Pa'n a Rêngram nangni pêk rang a nuom. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Nin neinun murdi zuor ungla, inrieng ngei pêk roi. Sumkok chettheiloia thun ungla, invâna achiem thei khâiloina ranga, inrungeiin an murûk thei khâiloina, rengên a siet thei khâiloina ranga ninta rangin rochon bûm roi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>No rochonngei omna kipa nu mulungrîl khom om tit a tih.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tîrlâm intûngchiena om</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Nin puon insilin, nin kong khitin, nin châti mochokin, tiklâi khomin intûng chienin om roi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat 25:1-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>tîrlâm, an pu innei ruolhoi renga juong rang lei ngâk chien anghan. A juongleh, inkhâr a tôka mo-ong kelen rangin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mk 13:34-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Tîrlâm, an pu juonga intûng chiena om ai juong mu chu mi satvur anni. Nang ki ril, a kong khit a ta, insung a ta, ngâk a tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Jânchima mo, arkhuona mo, a juonga intûng chiena ai mu ngei chu mi satvur anni. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Mahih riettit roi, in pumapa'n inru hong rang riet senla chu a in minset no nih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39,40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Masikin nangni khom intûng chienin om roi, nin tûng loi lâitakin Miriem Nâipasal juong a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tîrlâm iem om le iemomloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Peter'n, “Pumapa, hi chongmintêk hih keini rang vai mo ni ti, mi murdi rang mo?” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Pumapa'n a thuona, “tîrlâm iem om avâr tak, a pûn a insûng a cherêla, tîrlâm dang ngei azora kipa, an sâk a sem pe ranga uliena ai be chu tumo nini? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>a pu a honga, ha anga lei tho tîrlâm ai mu chu mi satvur ani. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Adiktakin nangni ki ril, ha tîrlâm tak hah a pun neinun enkolpun sin a tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Hannisenla ha tîrlâm han a mulungin, ku pu la juong vak no nih, tiin a tîrlâmpa ngei, a tîrlâmnu ngei jêm senla, sâkin nêkin lênrûi senla, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Ha tîrlâm hah ân ningloi, ân tûngloi kârin, a pu juong a ta, tuk nôinek a ta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:46: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tuk nôinek a ta; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">vôrpai ata.</char></note>, a iemloi ngei rangtum minchang a tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Tîrlâm a pu nuomlam riet chaka intûng loia, sin nuomloi chu na takin jêmpol nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Hannirese, riet loi sika, tôkmol sâkna rak tho minchâi chu jâmin jêm nîng a tih. Tutu atam an pêk kôma atam zong an ta, atam uol an ipêk kôma chu atam uol rok an tih.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua insenna abi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Pilchung mei leh hâl ranga juong kini, atûn khom kâng kelen tarse ku nuom. <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mk 10:38</ref></char></note> Baptisma ka chang ranga om hih, ânzoi mâka chu ki ning ânîp bah! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Rammuola inngeina min lêng ranga juongin mo mi nin tûng? Inngêina min lêng ranga juong ni mu unga, insenna min lêng ranga juong kêng kini. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Atûn renga insûngkuo inkhata mi rangnga insen an ta, inthum ngeiin inik ngei doi an ta, inik ngeiin inthum ngei doi an tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Pa ngeiin an nâingei, nâingeiin an pangei, nungeiin an nâinupangngei, nâinupangngeiin an nungei, tarpingeiin an moingei, moingeiin an tarpingei doi an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zora riettheina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Jisua'n mipui ngei kôma khom, “Nitâk tieng sûm a jînga anîn chu ruo a juong rang kêng nin tia, juong khom a juong ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Hanchu thînthi a hong sêma anîn chu alum rang kêng nin tia, alum khom alum ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Asarotholngei o! phil le invân nin ena, khuo om rang tie nin riet theia, ania, atûnlâi zora om tie ithomo nin riet thei loi?” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Indoipui leh inngêi rang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Ithomo nin theiin neinun dik sin rang nin mindon loi? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Mîn roijêkmuna nang an kai rangin chu, ha mi lehhan roijêkmun tung mân inngêina sinpui roh, aninôn chu, roijêkpu makunga nang kai a ta, intâng ina nang khum an tih. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Nang ki ril, poisa apêkte luo ne pêk let mâka chu mahan om ni tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Nunsiena renga nên sîr nônchu thi ni tih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ma lâiahan mi senkhatngei an oma, ha ngei han Galilee mingei Pathien kôma an inbôl lâia Pilat'n, mi a that thurchi Jisua an rila. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Ha anga, ithata an om hah Galilee rama midang ngei nêkin a nunsie uolin nin mindon mo?” <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>“Ni tet mak! Nangni ki ril, nangni khom nin sietna nin insîr nônchu, anni ngei angin nin thi var rang. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Mi sômleiriet ngei Siloam in insâng achima athi ngei hah Jerusalema midang ngei murdi nêkin an saloi uolin nin be mo? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Ni tet mak! Nangni ki ril nin sietna nin insîr nônchu anni ngei anghan thîng nin tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Theichang kung inraloi chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n hi chongmintêk hih a misîra, “Mi inkhatin a grape ruhuona theichang kung a linga. A mara a juong ena man maka. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Hanchu, ruhuon enkolpu kôma, ‘En roh, kumthum piel hih hi theichang kunga hin amara ku juong roka, inkhat luo man mu-ung.’ Phûrpai roh, ithomo mun ai luo tit ranga,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Ania ruhuon enkolpu han, “O pu, kumkhat mamang la om hi rese, a revêl tuk ka ta, a urna rangin vur ki tih. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Nakuma ânrân chu sa ok a ta, ânra nôn chu phûrpai roh” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sabathni nupang kholra a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Sabathni voikhat chu Jisua'n, synagog ina a minchua. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Ramkhori sûr nupang inkhat kum sômleiriet damloi a oma, inkona injîk thei loi ani. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n a mûn chu a koia, “Nuvengtenu na natna renga no jôk zoi” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>A chunga a kut a minngama, harenghan ân jîkzata, Pathien a minpâk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9">Jôk 20:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Bal 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref></char>
    </note> Hanchu, Jisua'n Sabathnîn mi a mindam sikin synagog taka ulienpu a ning a thika, mipui ngei kôma, “Sûnruk sin ei thona rang a om, ha nia han hong ungla dam roi, Sabathnîn chu ni no rese” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Pumapa'n a thuona, “Nangni, asarotholngei, nin serâtchal mo, nin sakuording mo, Sabathnin sûntin tui min nêk rangin nin tuong ngâi ni mak mo? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Hi nupang, Abraham jâisuon, kum sômleiriet, satanin ai khit hih, Sabathnin min jôk rang ni mak mo?” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>A chongthuon han a râlngei mâimôk an tonga, mipui lakin a sininkhêl sin sikin an râisâna.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ancham ru chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Jisua'n a rekela, “Pathien Rêngram hih imo ai ang? Ileh mo ki mintêk rang? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Ancham ru, mi inkhatin a lâka loilâia a tua. A kung ahonn insôna, thingkung ahong changa, a machangngeia han vangeiin rubu an phan anghan ani” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chol chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Jisua'n a rekel nôka, “Ileh mo Pathien Rêngram ki mintêk rang ani zoi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Nupang inkhat chol a lâka, vâipôl, liter sômminli leh a minpola athoi mâka tâidôna ai bil angha ani” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inkot in-ep</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:21-23">14:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Jisua'n Jerusalema a se malamin, khopuingei le khuotengeia mi a minchu ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Tumakhatin, O pu, mi tômte vai mo sanminjôka om rang? tiin a rekela. <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Inkot in-epa lût rang ranak song roi, mi tamtakin bôk an ta chu lût thei no ni ngei. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>A in pumapa ânthoia inkhâr akal suole chu, pêntieng indingin inkhâr tôk nin ta, ‘A pumapa, inkhâr mi mo-ong pe roh’ tîng nin ta, ama lakin, ‘Khotienga mi mo nin ni, nangni riet mu-ung, ko kôm renga rotpai roi,’ nangni tîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Maleh, nangnin, munkhatin ei sâka, ei nêka, kin khopuia khom mi ni minchu ngâi duo! la tîng nin tih.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Nikhomrese, ama han, “Khotienga mi mo nin ni, nangni riet ngâi mu-ung, Ko kôm renga rotpai roi, mipuoloi ngei nangni ti nôk a tih.” <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>“Ipaia nin om tikin chu chapin, hâ riel nin ta, Abraham ngei Isaac ngei, Jokob ngei le dêipungei murdi chu Pathien Rêngrama omin mûng nin tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28,29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mat 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Mingei sak le thang, sim le mâr renga hongin Pathien Rêngram ruolhoia insung an tih. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Hanchu atûna nûktak ânta ngei khom hih motontak la nîng an ta, motontak ngei khom nûktak la nîng an tih,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Jerusalem a châ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ha lâitaka han, Pharisee senkhat an honga, Jisua kôma, “Jôk inla hi mun renga hih mun danga rot ta roh, Herod'n nang that rang ai ti kêng,” an tipea. <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Jisua'n, “Se ungla ha sial hah varil roi, avien, nangtûk ramkhori rujûlpai ka ta, a sûnthum nîn ki sin zoi ki tih.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Ikhomnisenla, avien, nangtûk, hatûk ke se tit rang ani, Jerusalem pêntieng dêipu that ngâi ni mak an tia. <verse eid="LUK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“O, Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Dêipungei thatpu, no kôma Pathien'n a hongtîr ngei lung leh dêng thatpu, ârpuinûn a mantha nuoia ate ngei ai op ngâi anghan, voizet mo nang opbûm rang ko bôk zoi, ania nuom mak che. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Lap 118:26</ref></char></note> Masikin, Pumapa riminga hong chu ‘Pathien'n satvur rese’ nin ti mâka chu nin Biekin ram a ta, ni mu nôk khâi no tunui,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi inthing a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Sabathni voikhat chu, Pharisee ulien inkhat ina Jisua bu nêk rangin a siela, mîn an enrichika. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Mi inkhat a ke, a bânngei inthing, Jisua kôma a honga. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Jisua'n, Balam minchupungei le Phariseengei kôma, “Ei Balamin Sabathni mi mindam a phal mo, phal mak mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Hanchu an dâireka, Jisua'n damloi hah a sûra, a mindama, a min se zoia. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n an kôma, tumakhatin a nâipasal mo, a seratchal mo, Sabathnin tuikhura tâk senla, Sabathni nikhomrese, kelsuo kelen no tunui mo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat 12:11</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Hannisenla ha chong hah tutên thuon thei mak ngei.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nunnêmna le midontheina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>An mi siel ngei mi senkhatin sukmun asa an thang, a mûn chu Jisua'n hi chongmintêk hih a ril ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Mîn inneina ruolhoia nangni an sielin, sukmun asana insung no roi.” nin nêka mi lien uol an sielin chu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Chvr 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>in pumapa no kôma hongin, “Ama hi mun ot roh” tîng a ta mâimôk takin mun innuoina insung ni tih. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Manêk han, nang an siela anîn chu mun innuoina insung inla, a pumapa hong a ta, no kôma, “Mala, mun asana hong insung roh tîng a ta, hanchu, khuolmingei makunga mirit lông ni tih. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Omlien ngei kai intem an ta, omchîn ngei chu minlutin om an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Jisua'n a sielpu kôma khom, “Sûna mo, jâna mo, ruolhoi no tho tikin chu, na malngei mo, na lâibungngei mo, nu sûngsuokngei mo, nu bunga minei ngei mo, siel no roh, nônchu nang siel nôk an ta, nang thuon nôk an tih. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Ruolhoi no thôn chu inriengngei, a ôingei, kholrangei, mitchongei siel roh, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>nang an thuon theiloi sikin sat nang vur sâng a tih, midikngei inthoi nôk tika Pathien'n nang thuon a tih,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ruolhoi chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Hanchu, a khêng otpui inkhatin a chongril a rieta, a kôma, “Pathien Rêngrama ruolhoia insung rang ngei chu idôra râisân a om rang mo na!” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Mi inkhatin ruolhoi roiinpui tak a minsûka, mi tamtak a siela, <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>anêk zora tikin chu a mi siel ngei kôma, ‘Hong ta roi jâttin ânzoi zoi,’ iti rangin a tîrlâm a tîra. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Hanchu an rêngin inlêmna an nei chita, A motontak han a kôma, ‘Loi ko rochôka, a en ke se rang, ni muduol roh,’ a tia. <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Mi dangin, seratchal bop rangnga ko rochôka, a enmindik rangin ke se rang ani, ni lei muduol roh,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Mi dangin, “inkenei suobil kêng ania, masikin hong thei no ning,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Ma tîrlâm hah a se sirin chu a pu a rila. A pumapa hah a takasia, a tîrlâm kôm, “Se lalai inla, kotmâingeia, lamlienngeia, inriengngei, a ôingei, mitchongei, kholrangei hongtuong ngei roh,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Tîrlâm han a kôma, “O, pu ni ti anghan ko thoa, ania, mun tamtak a la tong” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Hanchu a pûn, a tîrlâm kôma han, “Sênla, lamliena, lamkêma mingei, ki in sipna rangin hongtuong lût roh. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Nang ki ril, mi ki siel ngei han tutên ka ruolhoia sâk noni ngei a ti,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ruoisi nina man</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:38">38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Voikhat chu mipui tampa Jisua leh an inruoia, an tieng ânheia, an kôma, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Tutu a nû le a pa, a lômnu le a nâingei, a lâibungngei le a sarnungei, le ama takpum nêka, lungkham mi mu uol nônchu, ko kôma hongin ku ruoisi nithei no nih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Tukhom ama khros ruputa mi jûi loipu chu ka ruoisingei nithei no nih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Tumakhatin in insâng sin rang bôk senla, insungin a sin zoina rang sum a dôn le dônloi mindon bak a tih. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Lungphûm a phûm suole, zoi thei khâi tano senla, a mu nâmin munuisan an tih. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>A in sin a phut nâka chu, zoi thei khâi mak tîng an tih.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Hanchu, tu rêng mo, a mi isângsôm leh rêng danga mi isângsômnik leh ama doi ranga juong, a ngam rang le ngamloi rang, insungin a mindon bak loi rang? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>A doi ngamloi rangin chu, alazana an la om lâiin, inngêina sin rangin thangthei tîr a tih. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Ma anghan, tutu nangni khom a nei murdi a mâk riei nônchu ku ruoisi ni thei no tunui.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Michi mangmunboi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Michi hi asa, ania, a alna boi ta senla chu, min al nôk thei ni khâi mak. <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Pil rang khomin, ur rang khom sa mak, vôrpai rang vai kêng. Kuor nin dônin chu rangâi roi,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Belri inmang chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1,2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29">Luk 5:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:30">30</ref></char>
    </note> Sûnkhat chu sumrusuongpungei mi tamtak le mi nunsiengei Jisua kôm chong rangâi rangin an honga. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Phariseengei le Balam minchupungeiin, “Hi mi hin, mi nunsiengei a modôma, munkhatin sâk khom an sâkpui ngâi,” tiin an chiera. <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Masikin, Jisua'n hi chongmintêk hih a rila.<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>Nin kâra inkhatlam hin belri razakhat nei ungla, inkhat inmang senla imo a tho rang? Sômkuoleikuo hah sûla mâng a ta, ânmang hah aman mâka rok noni mo? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>A manin chu râisân takin a dâra hong ruputin a ina hongpui a tih. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Hanchu a ruolngei, a bungmingei koitûp a ta, ke belri inmang ka man nôk zoia, ka râiasân. Masikin, râisânna mi tho pui roi tîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Ma anghan, nangni ki ril, mi sômkuoleikuo insîr nâng khâiloi ngei nêkin mi nunsie inkhat insîr sikin invâna râisânna a om uol ngâi.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sumdâr minmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Nupang inkhatin sumdâr sôm nei senla, inkhat minmang senla, imo tho ni? Châti mochokin a in phiet a ta, a man nôk mâka takintâi takin rok a tih. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>A man nôkin chu a chamnungei le a bungmingei koitûp a ta, an kôma, ku sumdâr minmang ka man nôk zoi ka râiasân, râisânna mi thopui roi tîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Nangni ki ril, ma anghan mi nunsie inkhat insîr sikin Pathien vântîrtonngei an râiasân ngâi.<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nâipasal rotpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Jisua'n, “Mi inkhatin nâipasal inik a neia; <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>nâipang uolin a pa kôma, ‘O, pa rochon ka chang rangtum chu atûn mi pêk ta roh,’ a tia. Hanchu, a rochon hah a nâingei an ruonin a sem pe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>A nâipang uol han, sûntomte suole chu a changtum murdi a juora a lâk rieia. Hanchu a in mâkin ram lataka a sea, nuomninga omin a sum a hekpe zoia. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Hanchu, a sum a hekpe suole chu, ha rama han mâitâm achula, ite sâk rang nei khâi maka. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Hanchu, ha rama mi inkhat ava pana, ama han a vokngei enkol rangin a loia a tîra. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Vokngei sâk ngâi bê hôkngei sâk rangin a ôi zoia, ania, tutên ama a sâk rang pêk mak ngeia.”<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>“Nangkana, a honng inrietsuok le chu, ‘Ka pa ina inlo mingei bu nêk zoiloi pêna a nei intam tia laka, kei lakate hin vonchâmin ki thi rang na! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Inthoi ka ta ka pa kôma se nôk ki tih, a kôma, O pa, Pathien chunga le nangma chunga ku nunsie zoi. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Na nâia be rangin luo chuk khâi mu-ung, no kôma inlo mi inkhat angin mi be ta roh,’ tîng ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>“Hanchu ânthoia, a pa kôma a se zoia. Lâtaka a la om lâiin a pa'n a lei mua, lungkham amu oka, a tâna, a kola, a tuma. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Hanchu, ‘O pa, Pathien chunga le nangma chunga, ku nunsie zoi, na nâia be rangin chuk khâi mu-ung,’ a tia. <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Hannisenla a pa'n, a suokngei kôma, Innot takin rovo satak min hak roi, a kutruola kutsabi minbun ungla, a kea kekok minbun roi. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Serat tuoi sa tak that ungla, râisânna ruolhoi sâk ei tih. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Hi ka nâipasal hih, a thia ân thoinôk ani; ânmanga man nôk ani,” a tia. Hanchu râisânna ruolhoi an phut zoi.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Hanchu a nâi ulien uolpu chu loia a oma, in a hongtung rangin chu, berlem miring le lâm rahang a rieta, <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Hanchu tîrlâm inkhat a koia, Imo ani zoi? tiin a rekela. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Hanchu, a kôma, “Na nâipa a hongkîr nôka, nin pa'n a ring a dama amu nôk sikin râisânnân serat tuoi thâitak a thata, ruolhoi a tho ani,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Hanchu, a ulienpa chu a taksi sabaka, ina khom lût nuom khâi maka, hanchu a pa a hongsuoka, a methêma. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Ania a pa kôma, “En roh, hi ten kum hih nata rangin tîrlâm sinin ki sina, no chong khom jôm loiin om ngâi mu-ung. Ania imo mini pêk ngâia? Ka malngei leh ruolhoi thona rangin, kêlte luo mi pêk ngâi mak che. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Hannisenla, hi na nâi norchon notizuorngei kôma ânchêk suole a hongkîr nôkin chu, serat tuoi thâitak na thatpui,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>A pân a kôma, “ka nâipasal ko kôma omtit kêng nini, ki nei murdi hih nata kêng. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Ania, râisâna ei mang rang kêng ani, na nâipa hih a thia a ring nôk kêng ani, ânmanga ei man nôk ani sikin,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Sum enkol iemomloi chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôma, “Mineipa inkhatin a tîrlâm, a rochon enkolpu a neia, a pu sum ânchêk tiin a pu kôma an nôna. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Masikin a pûn a koia a kôma, Nu chung roi ki riet hih inmo ani? Nu sum enkol, a roi an rêngin miziekin mi pêk roh, atûn renga chu sum enkolpu chang thei khâi no tinih,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Ha tîrlâm han, “ku pûn ki sinna ni minmâkin imo ki sin rang? pil tuk laka rât mu-unga, kutdo laka kên zaka,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Hanchu, ki sin hih ni minmâk tika, malngeiin an ina min man om theina rang chang ki riet zoi, a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Hanchu, a pu sum ântângngei nâm a koia, amotontakpa kôma, “idôrmo nêntâng?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Ama han, “Olive sariek ûm razakhat” a tia. A kôma, “hi nêntângna lekha, thuon inla, sômrangngân miziek roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Midang a rekel nôka, nangte idôr mo nêntâng? a tia. “Bu tumbu isângkhat” a tia. “Hi nêntângna lekha, razarietin miziek roh” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Hanchu, a pu sum enkolpu dikloi, a milak thei tie ânpâka, avâr nâingei nêkin rammuol nâingei hi atûnlai roia chu an vâr uol, a tia.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Jisua'n, “Nangni ki ril, rammuol rochonin ruol sin no ungla, aboi tikin kumtuong ina nin om theina rangin,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Tutu atômte chunga iemom chu atam chunga khom iem aom ngâi, tutu atômte chunga iemomloi chu atam chunga khom iemom ngâi mak. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Rammuol rochona luo iem nin om nônte, tumo rochon tak vâng hate nangni minrâk ranga? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Midang ta chunga luo iem nin om thei nônte, ninta hah tumo nangni pêk ranga? <verse eid="LUK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Tîrlâm inkhatin pu inik sin tho pe thei no nih. Inkhat heng a ta inkhat midit a tih, nônchu, inkhat sûr a ta, inkhat mathân a tih. Pathien le sum sin minlop thei no tunui,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua chongril senkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mk 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Hanchu, Pharisee, sum rangâiminlut ngei han a chong murdi an rieta, an chiera.<verse eid="LUK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Jisua'n an kôma, “Mi mitmua a dikin nin inlanga, ania, Pathien'n nin mulung a riet. Miriemin neinun aliena ai be hih Pathien mitmûn chu akâmboi ani,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>Moses Balam le dêipungei lekha ngei han Baptispu John tena hah a huoma, masuo renga chu Pathien Rêngram Thurchi Sa an misîra, mitinin rangrâta lût rangin an pût chita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Ania, Balam chong, miziek minhâng chînte boi nêkin invân le pil aboi abai uol.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char>
    </note> “Tutu a lômnu a mâka, midang a neiin chu a inrê ani, mi imâknu neipu khom a inrê ani.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mineipa le Lazarus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Mineipa inkhat a oma, puon mantam ngei silin nîngtinin hoiinhâia lêngin a om ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Inrieng inkhat, a riming Lazarus a vun pânin a tuom, mineipa inkot bula an hongtuong ngâi, a oma. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Mineipa dosâng nuoia bu ramal tâk nêk rang a nuoma, uingei lakin apân an miliek pe ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Inriengte hah a thia, invânram ruolhoia Abraham kôla insung rangin vântîrtonngeiin an tuonga. Mineipa khom a thia an phûma. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Ithi khuoa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mithi khuo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mârsi, mithi ngei omna mun.</char></note> ana tuongin a oma, a hong tanga lâtaka Lazarus, Abraham kôla insung a hong mua. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Hanchu ân-ieka, “O pa, Abraham lungkham ni mu inla, Lazarus a kutpâra, tui mindui senla, ke melei mindâi rangin ni juongtîr pe roh, hi meia hin ana ki rietrai zoi sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>“Ania, Abraham'n, Ka nâipasal, ni ring lâiin, neinunsa murdi na changa, Lazarus rêk chu asaloi murdi ai chang hah riet roh bah, ania atûn ama chu, hoi takin a oma, nang chu ana tuongin no om zoi ani. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Mapêna tutu anuom khomin, hi tieng renga ha tieng inkân thei loina rang le ha tieng renga hi tieng kânga hôn kân thei loina rangin ei kâra hin pil achat inthûk a om kêng,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Hanchu mineipa han, “O pa, Abraham, Lazarus hah ka pa insûngkuoa ni tîr pe rangin nang ki ngên. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Lâibung rangnga ke neia, hi natna muna an hong loina rangin ni juong ril pe rese,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abraham'n, “Na lâibungngei ril rang chu Moses le dêipungei an nei mo ka ta, ha ngei chong hah rangâi rese ngei,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>“Mineipa han, O, pa Abraham, mavai han chu chuk thei no nih, athi renga ânthoi ngei an kôma se vaiin kêng an sietna an insîr rang,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>“Ania, Abraham'n, Moses le dêipungei hê an lâk nônchu, athi renga inthoinôkin se senla ngei khoma, taksôn uol noni ngei,” a tipe.<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Inpalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:22">21:22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mk 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôma, inpalna hih omloi thei nimak, ania inpalna min ompu chung chu ântak bah na! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Hi mi chînte ngei lâia inkhatlam minpal chu, a minpalpu ringa han bunôilung minlîn tuikhangliena vôrpai ni senla, ata rangin sa uol a tih.<verse eid="LUK 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Singthei roi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref></char></note> na lâibungin nunsie a thôn chu ngo roh, ânsîrin chu ngâidam roh. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>nu chunga sûnkhatin voi sari saloi a thôn, voi sari kênsîr tiin, no kôm a hongin chu, na ngâidam ngêt rang ani.<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taksônna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Ruoisingei han a kôma, “Pumapa, kin taksônna mi min detpe uol roh,” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Hanchu, Pumapa han, “Ancham ru dôra hih taksônna nin neia anîn chu hi thingtheimu kung hih hong inphôi inla, tuikhangliena hong inphun roh, tîng nin ta nin he rangâi kelen atih,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tîrlâm sintum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Hanchu, nin lâia tumakhatin, tîrlâm pil tukin mo, belri hôlin mo, nei ungla, chuon a hong tungin, ‘Bukhalâi hong ot kelen roh’ tumo a ti rang nin nia? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Manêkin, ‘Ku bukhalâi ni do bak inla, rovo tho inla, ka sâk ke nêk suo mâka ni ngâk roh, masuole nêk ni tih,’ tumo a ti loi ranga? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Suokin chong a jôm sikin tumo râisânchong a ril ngâi? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Ma ang tak han, nin sintum nin sin suonûk khomin, tîrlâm papai kêng ei ni, ei sintum ei sin chak kêng nin ti rang ani.”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n miphâr sôm a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n Jerusalem a se malamin, Samaria le Galilee kâra ramria a lôna. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Khuo inkhat a lûtin chu miphâr sômin an intongpuia. Lâtaka an indinga, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>an inieka, “Jisua Minchupu, inrieng mi mu roh!” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Jisua'n a mu ngeia an kôma, “Se ungla, ochaingei kôma vân en roi”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Och 14:1-32</ref></char></note> a tipe ngeia. Lampuia chu an dam zoia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">an inthieng zoia: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">5:12. en roh</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Inkhatin chu a dam zoi iti a rietin chu, rôl inringtakin, Pathien minpâk pumin a hongkîr nôka. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Jisua ke bula inbokin râisânchong a rila, ha mi hah Samaria mi ani. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Jisua'n, “A damngei hah mi sôm nin nia, adang ikuo ngei hah khonmo an om? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Ithomo hi ramdangmi vai himo Pathien minpâk ranga hongkîr nôk?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Hanchu, a kôma, “Inthoi inla se ta roh, na taksônna hin nang a mindam ani,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien Rêngram juongtung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Pharisee senkhat ngeiin Pathien Rêngram juongtung rang roi an rekela, Jisua'n, “Pathien Rêngram chu mu theiin juongtung no nih. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Tutên ‘En roh,’ hin kêng a om, son kêng a om ti no nih. Pathien Rêngram chu nin lâia kêng a om,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nin sûnga; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu</char><char style="fq" closed="false">nin kâra, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu</char><char style="fq" closed="false">harenghan nin lâia inlang a tih.</char></note> tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Hanchu, a ruoisingei kôma, “Miriem Nâipasal ringlâi sûn hi sûnkhat te luo nin mu nuom ni, la om a tih; ania mu khâi no tunui.” <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Mîn nin kôma, “ ‘En roh sô soh!’ ‘En roh hi hih,’ tîng an tih, ania, a en rangin vase no roi. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Invâna kôl ânleka, kôlkung renga kôlmong dêna ai vâr ngâi anghan, Miriem Nâipasal juong ni lechu, nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Ania, ma mâna han tuong ok a ta, atûnlâi mingei hengpaiin om a tih.”<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Noah zora lâia anghan Miriem Nâipasal zora khom nîng a tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Aph 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Noah, rukuonga a lûta, tuilienin a that riei mâka chu mitinin an sâkin an nêka, nupang pasal omsiet an tho ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Aph 7:6-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Lot zora anghan mi tinin an sâkin an nêkin, an rochôka, an juora, an linga, in an sin ngâia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28,29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Aph 18:20—19:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Lot'n Sodom a mâk nin chu mei leh kât invân renga a juonga, a that riei ani. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Ma anghan, Miriem Nâipasal juong inlâr nîn chu juong om a tih.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Ha nîn chu inchunga ompûn, a neinun lâk rangin chum no rese. Ha angdênin, loia om khomin a ina hongkîr no rese.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mat 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mk 13:15-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Lot lômnu riettit ngâi roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Aph 19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Tutu a ringna mojôk rang bôk kaiin machân an ta, a machân kaiin jôk an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joh 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Nangni ki ril, ha ni jânin chu, jâlmun khata mi inik jâl an ta, inkhat tuong nîng a ta, inkhat mâk nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Nupang inikin sângsuk an ta, inkhat tuong nîng a ta, inkhat mâk nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Loia mi inik om an ta, inkhat tuong nîng a ta, inkhat mâk nîng a tih, a tia. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Senkhatin rachang 36 na dôn mak ngei: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mi inik loia chuonsin an ta: inkhat tuongpaiin om a ta, adang hah mâksan nîng a tih</char><char style="ft" closed="false">en roh, Mat 24:40.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Hanchu, ruoisingeiin, “Pumapa khotieng mo?” an tia. Jisua'n, “Ithi ruok omna kipa sêlkurungei intûp an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Meithâi le roijêkpu chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Hanchu, sabei mindong loia chubai an tho tit rang ani iti rilna rangin hi chongmintêk hih Jisua'n a misîra. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>“Khopui inkhata hin roijêkpu, Pathien khom chiloi, mi lien khom chiloi inkhat a oma. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Ha khou nanâka han meithâi inkhat a oma, ân dôipui chunga phuba lâk ranga ngênin a se bang ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Zora sôtzan chu roijêkpu han nuom pe maka, ania nûka a mulungin, ‘Pathien le mi lien chi no khom inlang, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>hi meithâi hin chakal ni tho banga, hi anga hin a hong banga anîn chu nûka chu ni la minjêl chit a tih. Masikin a phuba lei luokpui rong,’ a tia.”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Pumapa'n, a chongril ala zoma, “Rangâi ta u, imo ha roijêkpu saloi han ai ti. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Masikin, Pathien'n a mingei sanna ngêna, sûntin, jântina chapngei chungroi mindon noni mo? San minnu ni mo? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Nangni ki ril, an nuomnan inrang takin mindon pe a tih. Ania, Miriem Nâipasal a juong tikin rammuola taksônna mu ni mo?” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pharisee le sumrusuongpu chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Ama le ama ka sa intia, midang esêl ngâi ngei kôma hi chongmintêk hih a misîra. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>Voikhat chu mi inikin Biekina chubai tho rangin an sea. Inkhat chu Pharisee ania inkhat chu sumrusuongpu ani. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Pharisee chu athenin ândinga chubai a thoa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">athenin indingin chubai a thoa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ândinga chubai a thoa </char></note> “Pathien, kei chu midang ngei angin mi ranghuol ngâi, dikloi, inrê mi khom kini loi sikin, râisânchong ki ril. So, sumrusuongpu anga khom ki niloi sikin râisânchong ki ril. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Hapta tin sûnnik bu ke ngêi ngâia, ke nei murdi a sômakhat nang ke pêk ngâi,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Ania, sumrusuongpu chu lâtaka indingin, invân tieng luo tang ngam loiin, a rôp ruchumin, “Pathien, mi nunsie ki ni, inrieng ni mu roh,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref></char>
    </note> Jisua'n nangni ki ril, “Pharisee mi ni loiin, sumrusuongpu chu Pathien mita theiintumin, a in tieng a se zoi. Tutu omlien kaichu intem an ta, intem kaichu minlutin om an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n nâipangte ngei sat a vut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Mi senkhatin, an nâitengei Jisua kôma, an chunga kut minngam rangin an tuonga. Hanchu, ha anga tho rang hah ruoisingeiin an lei mûn chu an lei ngoa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Hannisenla, Jisua'n nâipangte ngei a kôma a koia, an kôma, “Nâipangtengei ko kôma hong rese ngei, khap no roi, Pathien Rêngram chu hi anga nâipangte ngei ta kêng. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Diktakin ki ti, tutu nâipangte'n Pathien Rêngram ai modôm anga modôm loiin chu asûnga lût tet no nih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mineipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Juda ruoipu'n Jisua a rekela, “Minchupu sa, kumtuong ringna ka manna rangin imo ko tho rang?” a tia <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Ithomo asa mini ti? Pathien pênna chu tute misa omak. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Jôk 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Bal 5:18</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Jôk 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Bal 5:17</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:15">Jôk 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Bal 5:19</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:16">Jôk 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Bal 5:20</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Jôk 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Bal 5:16</ref></char></note> Chongpêk hah, ni riet duo, Inrê no roh, mi that no roh, inru no roh, dikloiin mi nôn no roh, na nû le na pa mirit roh,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Ama han, “Ha chongpêkngei murdi hah chu ka nâipangte lâi renga ko jôm kêng ani” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Mahah Jisua'n a riet lehan a kôma, “Neinun inkhat tho rang na la nâng, Ne nei murdi juor inla, asum hah inriengngei sem ngei roh, hanchu, invâna rochon nei ni tih, male chu hong inla ni jûi roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Mahah ama'n a riet lehan, ânngûi oka, miriem neipa ani sikin.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n ânngûi a mûn chu, “Minei ngei Pathien Rêngrama lût rang ântak bah na! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Ut simphuoi kuora lût rang ântak nêkin mineingei invân rêngrama lût rang intak uol a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>A chongril riet ngei nâmin, “Hanchu tumo sanminjôk nithei ranga?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Jisua'n, “Miriem ranga nitheiloi hih Pathien rangin chu nithei ani,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Male Peter'n a kôma, “En roh! kin inngei mâkin nang kin jûi hih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Jisua'n an kôma, “O, ani, adiktakin nangni ki ril, tutu Pathien Rêngram sika a in mo, a lômnu mo, a nu le pa mo, a lâibungngei mo, a sarnungei mo, a nâingei mo, mâk kai chu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>anêka tam uolin atûna ringlâi le zora la hong ranga kumtuong ringna khom la man ngêt a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n a thi rang a misîr avoithumna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Hanchu ruoisi sômleinik ngei hah Jisua'n atheiin a tuong ngeia an kôma, “Rangâi ta u, Jerusalema ei se rang ania mahan, Miriem Nâipasal chungroi dêipungei lei miziek hah tung a tih. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Jentailngei kuta pêk an ta, esêl an ta, munuisan an ta, michilkhum an tih. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Jêm an ta, that an tih, ania, sûnthum suole aringin inthoi nôk a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Ania, ruoisingei han a chong reng rietthei mak ngeia, a chong ti hah anni rangin chu chong inthup ani sikin Jisua'n imo ai ti riet mak ngei.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n kutdo mitcho a mindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n Jericho a tung rangin lampui kôla mitcho inkhat ânsunga, kut a doa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Mipui rahang a rietin chu, “Imo hi? tiin a rekela.<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>“Nazereth Jisua a hongvun ani,” an tipea.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Ânieka, “Jisua! David Nâipasal, inrieng ni mu roh” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Moton tienga om mipui ngeiin, “Dâirek roh” tiin an ngoa. Ania ama'n ânring uolin, “David Nâipasal! inrieng mi mu roh,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Masikhan Jisua ân ngama, mitcho hah hongtuong rangin chong a pêka. A hongnâia anîn chu Jisua'n a rekela. <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Imo nang ki tho pe ranga ni nuom?” a tia. “O pu, amu nôk ku nuom,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Anîn chu muthei roh, na taksôn nân nang a mindam ani,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Harenghan a muthei kelen zoia, Pathien minpâk pumin Jisua a jûi zoia. Mipui ngeiin mahah an mûn chu an rêngin Pathien an minpâk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Zacchaeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n Jericho lûtin apala. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Mahan sumrusuongpungei ulientak a riming Zacchaeus an ti mineipa a oma. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Jisua hah i-anga mi mini, mu rang a nuoma, ania miriem dungbong ania, mipui tamrai sikin mu thei maka. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Hanchu Jisua'n ma lampui a hongvun rang sikin, mipui moton tieng Jisua mu rangin a tâna, Theichangpui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Theichangpui </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ei ti hih English chongin </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sycamore </char><char style="ft" closed="false">an tia, apanga amara kop ngâi jât ania theichang ranga lien uol ani.</char></note> kunga a kala. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Jisua'n ha mun a hong phâka anîn chu a tanga a kôma, “Zacchaeus juong chum lai roh, avien chu ni ina kêng ku tung ngêt rang,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zacchaeus hah innot takin a juong chuma, râisân takin a ina a mintung zoi. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Mipui a mu ngei nâmin an chiera, “Mi nunsie ina kêng tung rangin a se rek zoi so,” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Hanchu, Zacchaeus ândinga, Pumapa kôma, “Rangâi roh, O Pu! Ke neinun in-ang ânriengngei pêk ka ta, hanchu tutu, lei huong ta khom inlang, abâk minlîn thuon nôk ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Avien, hi ina hin sanminringna a tung zoi, hi mi khom hih Abraham richi ani sikin. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Miriem Nâipasal hih ânmangngei roka sanminring rang piela juong ani,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mat 18:11</ref></char></note> a tia.<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rângkachak sumdâr chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Hanchu, ha a chongril an rangâi lâiin Jerusalem anâi zoi sik le Pathien Rêngram juong inlang kelen ranga an sabei sikin chongmintêk a misîra. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Hi chong hih a rila, “Mi lien inkhatin rêng changna roi hong lâka hongkîr nôk rangin ram lâtaka a sea. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>A se rangtôn chu a suokngei sôm a koia, rângkachak sumdâr a pêk chita, ‘ko hong nôk mâka lei muphung roi’ a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Ania, a ram mingeiin an hengpaia, a nûka palâi an tîra, ‘Hi mi hih kin rêng rangin nuom makme an ti,’” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Hanchu, rêng an minchang zoiin a hongkîr nôka, idodôr mo an lei muphung rekel rangin a suokngei hah a makunga a koitûpa. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Amotontakpu a honga, “O, Pu, mina pêk hah rângkachak sumdâr sômin ku muphung,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>A kôma, “No tho min sa, tîrlâm sa ni ni, neinun tômte chunga iem no om sikin, kholien sôm ngei chunga ulienin nang min chang ki tih,” a tipea. <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>A tîrlâm inikna a honga a kôma, “O Pu, inkhat mina pêk hah rângkachak sumdâr rangngan ku muphung,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Hanchu, ama kôma han, “Nang khom khopuilien rangnga ngei chunga ulienin om roh,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Hanchu, adang a honga, “O Pu, en ta, na rângkachak sumdâr mi na pêk hah mâihûinân ku sûna ka darchien. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Mi inngar tak nini sikin nang ki chi ani. Na darloi khom na lâka, nu tuloi khom na ât ngâi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>A kôma, tîrlâm saloi ni ni, no chong nanâkin theiloi nang amintum. Mi inngar tak ki nia, ka darloi khom ka lâk ngâia, ku tuloi khom ka ât ngâi ni rieta, <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>anînte, ithomo ku sum hih a pungna ina ne lei dar loi, ko hong nôka hin apung leh ka man rang kêng ani, a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Hanchu, a kôla inding ngei kôma han, “A rângkachak sumdâr lâk pe ungla, sôm adônpu pêk roi,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Hanchu, ama'n a kôma, “O Pu, anîn chu rângkachak sumdâr sôm a dôn mo ka ta,” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref></char></note>Ama han an kôma, “Nangni ki ril, tutu a nei viet kai chu pêk mintam uol nîng a ta, a nei loi kai chu ai dôn viete khom hah lâk pe rip nîng a tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>“Hi ka râlngei, an rêng ranga minuom loi kai chu hong tuong ungla ka makunga that roi a ti” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Inlal taka Jerusalema a lût</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joh 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Ma chong hah a misîr zoiin chu Jerusalem panin moton ânsa. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Bethphage le Bethany khuo kôl Olive muol a tungin chu, an motona a ruoisi inik a tîra, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>“nin motona khuoa son vase ungla, nin lûtin, tute la chuongna ngâi loi sakuording te inthung mûng nin tih, sût ungla hin hongkai roi. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Tukhomin ithomo nin sût tiin an rekelin chu, Pumapa'n a nâng ani tipe roi,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Hanchu, an sea Pumapa'n a ti lam ang takin an va mua, <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Sakuordingte an sûtin chu a pumangeiin, “Ithomo nin sût?” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Hanchu an kôma, “Pumapa'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a pu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a pumapa.</char></note> ai nâng ani,” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Sakuording te hah Jisua kôma an kaia, a chunga an puonngei an dâpa, Jisua an min chuonga. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>A sena rang lampuia khom an puonngei an dâp tira.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Hanchu, Jerusalem tung ranga Olive muol chum rangin chu a ruoisingeiin a sininkhêl sin an mu sikin rôl inring takin Pathien an minpâka. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Lap 118:26</ref></char></note> “Pumapa riminga hong rêngpa chu Pathien'n satvur rese, invâna inngêina lêngin Pathien roiinpui rese,” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Mipui lâia Pharisee senkhatin Jisua kôma, “Minchupu, nu ruoisingei dâirek rangin ril roh,” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Jisua'n an kôma, “Nangni ki ril, hi ngei hih an dâirekin chu, lungngei tena luo an iniek rang ani,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Jerusalem a châna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Hanchu, an tung rangtôn chu, khopui hah a mua a châa. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>“Ratha'nngamna chong hih avienni tena luo hin ni riet nita senla chu O! Aniatate mu thei khâi mak chea. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Zora hongtung a tih, na râlngeiin nu rukul bula pil minpôngin nang huolvêl an ta, kil tina nang khap tit an tih. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Nu rukul sûnga ni mingei le nang minmang chit an tih, nu sûnga lung inchuon reng hôi no ni ngei; nang minring ranga Pathien juonglâi ni riet loi sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Biekina a se</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joh 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n Biekina ava lûta, neinun juorngei hah a rujûla. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note> An kôma, “Lekhabua miziekin Pathien'n, Ki in chu chubai thona in tîng an tih, a tia. Ania nangni rêkin chu inrungei khurin kêng nin sin hi,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk 21:37</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jisua'n anîngtin Biekina a ril ngei ngâia. Ochaisingei, Balam minchupungei le mipui ruoipungeiin that rang an bôka. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Hannisenla, mipui ngeiin ningsiet taka a chongril an rangâia bâikhat luo minsam rang an nuom ngâiloi sikin, a tho rang lam man mak ngei.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua rachamneina an rekel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Sûnkhat chu Jisua'n Biekina mingei a minchua, Thurchi Sa a misîr pe ngei lâiin, Ochaisingei, Balam minchupungei le upangei an honga, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>a kôma, “Tu rachamin mo hi sin ngei hih no tho, tumo rachamneina nang a pêk?” miril roh an tipea.<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Jisua'n an kôma, “Kei khom chong inkhat nangni rekel rong. Ni ril roi, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>John han, Pathien rachamin mo, miriem rachamin mo mi a Baptis ngâi?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>An thenin an inkhala, “Imo ie ti rang? Pathien rachamin, ei ti lakin, itho mo John hah nin iem loi? mi tîng a ta. <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Miriem rachamin ei ti lakin, hi mipui ngei hin lungin mi dêng an tih, John hah dêipu ani itia an pom sikin, an tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Masikin, riet mak meh” tiin an thuona. <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n an kôma, “kei khomin tu rachamin mo hi sinngei hih ko tho nangni ril uol no ning,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Grape ruhuon inlo mingei chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisua'n hi chongmintêk hi mipui ngei a rila, “Mi inkhatin grape ruhuon a thoa, a donsûingei kôma a chuon inlo rangin a pêka, asôtzan va châm rangin ram danga a sea. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Hanchu grape ramal zora a hong nîn chu a changtum lâk rangin a enkolngei kôma a tîrlâm inkhat a tîra. A enkolngeiin, a tîrlâm hah an jêma, kut korongin an min se nôka. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Hanchu, tîrlâm dang a tîr nôka, ama khom hah an lei jêma, mâimôk ânsak bita, kut korongin an tîr nôka. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Tîrlâm dang, a inthumna a tîr nôka, ama khom hah an lei mophop nenga, an vôrpaia. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Masuole chu grape ruhuon pumapa han, ‘Inmo ko tho rang ani zoi?’ ka nâi moroitak tîr ka ta, ama chu lei jâ ngêt an tih, a tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Hannisenla, ruhuon enkolpungei han an lei mu lehan, ‘Hi mi hih a pumapa nâi ani. That ei ti u, hanchu a rochon ei ta nîng a tih’ tiin an inruola <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Hanchu ruhuon pêntieng an kelsuoa, an that zoia. Jisua'n, ‘A pumapa han ruhuon enkolpungei hah imo lo ta nih?’” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>“Hong a ta, ha mingei hah that a ta, grape ruhuon hah a enkolpu dangngei pêk a tih,” a tia. Ha chong hah an rieta anîn chu, “Madôrpa chu tho noni ngei nga” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Lap 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisua'n a en ngeia, an kôma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Lekhabu'n ai ti hih imo atina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">In sin ngeiin an hengpai mangmunboia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">an ibe hah, a kila lung kâmomtak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">a chang zoi,” iti hih.<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>“Tutu ha lung chunga inpal kai chu koichit an ta, ha lungin a dêng ngei vângchu innôi indichit an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chôiruol roia rekelna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Balam minchupungei le Ochaisingeiin ma mun renghan Jisua sûr kelen rang an bôka. Hi chongmintêk hih anni demna ani iti an riet sikin. Ania, mipui laka an chia. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Masikin chuminrên an roka, isûra, racham le ranak dônpu Rom Governor kuta an pêk theina rangin mi senkhat misa anga inlêma, Jisua enrichik rangin mi an tîra. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Mangei han a kôma, “Minchupu, ni ti ngei le ni minchuna ngei hih adik. Tute zenuol nei loiin Pathien lungdo chongtak ni minchu ngâi iti kin riet. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Hanchu, Rom Rêng Caesar kôma chôiruol kin chôi hih ei balamin ani mo, ni mak mo? Mi ril roh” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Hannisenla an boti hah a rieta. <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>An kôma, “Sumdâr hah ni min en ta u, tu rimil le tu riming mo a chuong?” a tia. Anni han, “Rom Rêng, Caesar,” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Mahah anîchu, “Caesar ta chu Caesar pêk ungla, Pathien ta chu Pathien pêk roi hana,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Hanchu, mipui makunga ite chong achâina sûr mak ngeia, a chongthuon lam hah an kamâma, an dâirek zoi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inthoinôk roi rekelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Sin 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hanchu Saducees senkhat, inthoinôkna omak ti ngâi ngei an honga, Jisua kôma, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Bal 25:5</ref></char></note>“Minchupu, Moses'n, tukhomin a lâibungpân lômnu nei senla, nâi nei loiin thi ta rese, a nâipa'n, ha nupang hah luo nôkin a ulienpa richi rang a min nei rang ani, tiin a mizieka. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Voikhat chu, urêng pasal sari an oma, a ulientakin lômnu a neia, nâi nei loiin a thia. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>A innik nân ma nupang hah a luo nôka, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>a inthum nân a luo nôka, ha angdêna han a sarina dênin an luoa, nâi nei loiin an thi rieia. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Anûktaka nupangnu khom hah a thi zoia. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Inthoinôk tikin te atu lômnu tak mo ai ni rang ani zoi? An urêngin laka lômnûn an nei chita,” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Jisua'n “Atûnlai mingei an innei ngâi, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Hannisenla, thina renga inthoinôk theiruo ngei le zora la hong ranga lêng theiruo ngei chu lômnu lômpa innei khâi noni ngei. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Vântîrtonngei angin om an ta, thi thei khâi noni ngei. Thina renga an inthoinôk zoi sikin, Pathien nâingei nîng an ti zoi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Jôk 3:6</ref></char></note>Moses khomin ânthârlakin athia ânthoinôk rang roi chu chîmbuk akânga han Pumapa chu ‘Abraham Pathien, Isaac Pathien, le Jacob Pathien’ tiin a rila. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ama chu aring ngei Pathien ania, athi ngei Pathien nimak, ma taka han chu mi murdi an ring let sikin,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Balam minchupu senkhatin, “Minchupu, nu thuona adik” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Masuole chu ite rekel ngam khâi mak ngei.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Messiah roia rekelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Jisua'n, Messiah hih inmo David Nâipasal ani thei rangtie?<verse eid="LUK 20:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:42,43: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>David lele han Lapuibua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Pumapa han ku Pumapa kôm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Ka changtieng insung roh;<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>Na râlngei ki sirphân</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">Ka dar mâka chu” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>“David lele khomin ‘Pumapa’ a ti rêka, hante inmo Messiah hah David suonpâr ani thei rangtie,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Balam Minchupungei a rilna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Lokongei chong an rangâi lâiin, a ruoisingei kôma, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Balam minchupungei renga singthei roi. Kâncholiinchuol inhaka lêng an nuom ngâia, bazar muna chubai inmûk, Synagog-a sukmun hoi, ruolhoi jôla sukmun asa ngên ngâi anni. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Meithâingei sum an sâka, mi huongnân sôt tatak an chubai ngâi; ha ngei han an tuong rang na uol a tih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Meithâinu chôiruol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mk 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Jisua'n a en titira, Biekina chôiruol dôngna, minei ngeiin an chôiruol thâk a mua. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Meithâi inriengte'n sumdâr chînte inik a thâklâi khom a mu saa. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>“Mi dadangngei nêkin hi meithâi inriengte hin a thâk mintam uol. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Mi dangngei chu an nei minieng kêng an pêk, ania, ama'n chu ai dônsunte, kêng ai pêkrip,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biekin siet rang roi a misîrna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mk 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Ruoisi senkhat ngeiin Biekin lung ânvo enhoi tie le Pathien kôma an neinunpêk an misîr lâiin, Jisua'n an kôma, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Nikhuo la hong tung a tih, nin mu ngei murdi amuna oma, lung inchuon reng om no nih,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Intakna le nuomlôna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Anni han a kôma, “Minchupu, mahah tika mo ai ni rang? Ahongtung rang zora rietna minsinna imo a om rang?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Jisua'n, “Nangni an huong loina rangin singthei roi. Mi tamtakin Khrista ki ni, azora atung zoi kêng, keima riming pêlin hong an ta, ha mingei hah jûi no roi. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Hanchu, indoi, insuol roi nin riet tikin chi no roi, mahah a tung masa ngêt rang ani, a zoinatak chu la tung kelen no nih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Nam dang le nam dang, ram dang le ram dang indoi an ta; <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Muntina ningnupui, mâitâm, ripui lêng a ta, invâna neinun kamâmruoi le ichiom ngei inlang a tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Nikhomrese, ma ngei tungmân han nangni sûr an ta, an nuom nangni lông an ta, synagog taka nin roijêk rangin pêng an ta, lung ina nangni khum an tih. Keima sikin rêngngei, roijêkpungei makunga nangni tuong an tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Mahah nin ranga Thurchi Sa rilna zora sa nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14,15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char></note> Lei riet roi, inmo ênpiel rang, inmo ei thuon rangtie tiin nin kângmindoi no roi. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Nin râlngeiin an sût theiloi rang dôrin chong theina le vârna nangni pêng ki tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Nin nû, nin pa, nin lâibung, nin sûngsuok, nin ruolngeiin nangni minsûr an ta, senkhat chu nangni that an tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Keima sikin mitinin nangni mumâk an tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Ania, nin sam sangkhat te luo inmang no nih, <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Adetin inding ungla insaninjôk nin tih.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Jerusalem siet rang roi a rilna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mk 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Hanchu, râlmingeiin Jerusalem an huol nin mu tikin chu a siet rang ani zoi iti riet ta roi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Matikin chu Judea rama om ngei chu tânga rot rese ngei, asûnga om ngeiin chu suoksan rese ngei, rama om ngei chu khopuiliena lût no rese ngei. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref></char></note>Lekhabua ânziek atung indikna rangin ha nikhuongei chu, ‘Phuba luok ni nîng a tih.’ <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Nupang nâivongngei le nû nâi rununêk dônngei rangin chu nikhuo intak inthangtak nîng a tih, dûktongna inthang, hi rama hin a juong tung rang sik le Pathien taksina hi mingei chunga atung rang sikin. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Senkhat khandaiin thîng an ta, Adangngei ram tina suokin tuongin om an tih. Hanchu an zora achuk mâka Jerusalem chu Jentailngei sirdênin om a tih.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miriem Nâipasal juong rang roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezek 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Joel 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Chph 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref></char>
    </note> “Hanchu, nisa, thâ, ârsi ngeia khin minsinna om a ta, tuikhanglien rahang le tui insôn sikin pilchunga khom jâttin dengthei, lungjîng mintung a tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Pilchung pumpuia ichi juong tung mindonin mingei jâmzalin inzal neng an ta, invân-lâijôla neinun bulpui ngei rujûlpai nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Chph 1:7</ref></char></note> Male Miriem Nâipasal inlang a ta, roineina le roiinpui takin sûm lâia juong a tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Hanchu, ha ngei hah a juong tung phutin chu inding ungla, tang roi, nin jôkna rang anâi zoi sikin.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Theichang kunga inrilna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Hanchu, hi chongmintêk hih Jisua'n a rila, “Theichang kung le thingkung dadang ngei mindon roi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>A hong incher innoi nin mûn chu, kholum anâi iti nin riet ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Ha anghan, ha ngei hong tung nin mûn chu, Pathien Rêngram a juong tung rang ani zoi iti rieng nin tih. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Atûnlâi mingei an thi riei mân ngêtin hi neinunngei hih juongtung a tih, iti riet roi. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Pil le invân boi a ta, ko chong chu boi no nih.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Intûng chien anâng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Singthei roi, aninon chu, sâk akhoprai le ju inrûi le ringlâi nunkhohoi mindonnân nin mulung sip rai a ta, ha nikhuo hah juong tungrak a tih, <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>chânga inôk anghan. Ha anghan pilchung muntina mi murdi chunga tung a tih <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Ha intakna juong tung rang adamriema nin pal theina rang, ranak nin dôn theina rang le Miriem Nâipasal makunga nin inding theina rangin indînin khotiklâi khomin chubai tho tit ngâi roi,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jisua'n ha sûnngei hah Biekina minchûn a minhek ngâia, kholoi a hong nin chu Olive muola a jân mang rangin a se ngâi. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Anîngtin, jînga a chongril rangâi rangin a kôma Biekina mi murdi an hong ngâi.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua that rang lam an mintuo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:10-11">Joh 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Jôk 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hanchu, cholboi vâipôl ruolhoi, Kalkânkût ruolhoi an iti hah anâi zoia. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Ochaisingei le Balam minchupungeiin mipui an chi sikin inrûka Jisua that rang lam an roka.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas'n Jisua minsûr rang a masat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mk 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Ruoisi sômleinik ngei lâia Judas Iscariot an iti ngâi sûnga Soitan a lûta. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Hanchu Ochaisingei le Inkhomin ulienngei kôm a sea, Jisua an sûr theina rang lam a vân kerengpuia. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Anni han an râisân oka, sum pêk rangin an inkhâma. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Hanchu, Judas a nuoma, mipui riet loi kâra minsûr rang chuminrên a rok zoi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le a ruoisingei kalkân kût an kâk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joh 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Hanchu, cholboivâipôl ruolhoi, Kalkân kût khalâiot, belrite that rang ni a hong tunga. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Jisua'n hi chong minchôiin Peter le John a tîra. “Se ungla eini sâk rang Kalkân kût va minsûk roi,” a tia <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Hanchu a kôma, “Khonmo kin minsûk rang?” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>An kôma, “khopuilien nin lût lehan, mi inkhat bêla tui chôi tong nin ta, a lûtna ina jûipat roi. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Hanchu, in pumapa kôma, ‘Minchupu'n ku ruoisingei leh Kalkân kût kin sâkna rang khâltan khonmo a ti?’ ti roi. <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Hanchu, chunginchuon khâltan inzar tak, neinun nâm omsai, nangni min mûng a ta, mahan minsûk roi,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Hanchu an sea, Pumapa'n an kôma a ti lam angin jâtinrêng an mua, mahan kalkân kût an mintuo zoi ani.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumapa Jânbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Hanchu, asâk zora ahong nîn chu a tîrton sômleinik ngei leh khalâi a ota. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>An kôma, “Ku tuong mân, hi Kalkân kût hih nangni sâkpui rang ku nuom sabak ani. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Nangni ki ril, Pathien Rêngrama a tatakin ani mâka chu sâk khâi no ning,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Male, kilât a lâka, Pathien kôma râisânchong a ril zoiin chu an kôma, “Hihi lâk ungla buong roi. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Nangni ki ril, Pathien Rêngram a juong tung mâka chu hi uain hih buong khâi no ning,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Male, vâipôl a lâka, Pathien kôma râisânchong a ril zoiin chu a khoia, a pêk ngeia an kôma, “Hihi ka taksa, ninta ranga ipêk ani. Mi nin riettitna rangin tho ngâi roi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Ha angin, an sâk zoiin chu, kilât a lâka, “Hi kilât hih Pathien chongtung thar ki thisena sînthona, ninta ranga bun suok ani,” a tipe ngeia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu Jisua chongbâingei ommak </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahih ka taksa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rachang 19, na le rachang 20 na.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Lap 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hannisenla, en ta u, ni minsûr rangpu chu ka khalâi otpuipu hih ani. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Pathien mintuo anghan, Miriem Nâipasal chu thîng a tih, ania, a minsûrpu chung chu ântak bah na! <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Hanchu an lâia tutakin mo, ma anga tho rang ai ni rang ani zoi? tiin an inrekel inlôma.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alientak rang chungroia inkhalna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mk 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk 9:46</ref></char>
    </note> Hanchu, ruoisingei lâia a tutak mo alientaka be rang tiin inkhalna a oma. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Jisua'n an kôma, “Jentail rêngngei chu an mingei chunga racham an neia, racham a nei ngei chu ‘mipui ngei mal’ an ti ngâia. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25,26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mk 10:42-44</ref></char></note> Ania, nangni chu ha anghan nino tunui, nin lâia alientak chu nâipang uolin om senla, ruoipu rang chu tîrlâm angin om rese. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Joh 13:12-15</ref></char></note>Tumo alien uol, bu nêk ranga insungpu mo, bukhalâi dôpu mo? Bu nêkpu nîng a tih. Ania, kei chu nin lâia tîrlâm angin ko oma.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Huong ranga methêmna ko tong kâra ni ompui ngei nin ni. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Ka Pa'n racham ni pêk anghan, racham nangni pêk ki tih. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref></char></note>Ke Rêngrama ko dosânga sâk nan ta, nêk nan ta, Rêngsukmuna insungin Isreal jât sômleinik ngei chunga roijêk nin tih.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n a ipdel rang a rilmasâna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joh 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>“Simon, Simon, rangâi ta! Butak le arishi an jâp ngâi anga nangni minsîna asa le sie nangni kidik rangin Soitanin phalna a man zoi. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Hannisenla, na taksônna ânsam loina rangin nangni ku chubai pe, ki tieng ni kîr tikin na lâibungngei ni mindet rang ani,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Peter'n a thuona, “Pumapa, no kôma intâng ina intâng rang le athi rang khomin kên phal,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Jisua'n, “Peter, nang ki ril, avienjân hin, voithum riet ngâi mu-ung ni ti mâka chu âr khuong no nih,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sumkok, choli, le khandai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mat 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mk 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char>
    </note> Hanchu, Jisua'n an kôma, “Sumkok, choli, kekok, boia nangni ki tîr lâia han imo nin insama?” tiin a rekela, “Ite insam mak me” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Jisua'n atûn chu, sumkok, choli, anei khomin chôi ta roi, khandai nei loi khomin a kâncholi zuor senla rochôk rese. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char></note>Nangni ki ril, Lekhabu'n, “Ama chu mi nunsiengei lâia telsa ani zoi” itia ku chung roi miziek hah, ku chunga ai tung indik rang ani. <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Ruoisingeiin a kôma, “Pumapa, en ta, hin khandai inik a om” an tia. Ahun a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olive muola Jisua chubai tho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Hanchu, a tho ngâi lam angin, khopuilien a mâka, Olive muola a sea, ruoisingei khomin an jûia. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Amun an tungin chu an kôma, “Huongna nin lût loina rangin chubai roi” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Hanchu, an kôm renga lunga dêngphâkna tena a vân thîna, khûkinbilin chubai a thoa. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>“O Pa, nu nuomin chu hi dengtheina kilât hih ko kôm renga khâi roh. Nikhomrese, keima racham ni loiin, na racham tak ni rese” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Hanchu, vântîrton invân renga a kôma a juong inlâra, râtna a juong pêka. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Ngâisiet inrikin, ningsiet uolin a chubaia, a rathan khom thisen angin pila a masara.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhat ngei chu rachâng 43-44 dôn mak ngei.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Hanchu, chubai thona renga inthoiin ruoisingei kôma a sea, sabeidonga a inin a va mu ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>An kôma, “Ithomo nin in? Inthoi ungla, huongna nin tâk loina rangin chubai roi,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua an sûr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Joh 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Jisua a la chong lâiin ruoisi sômleinik ngei lâia Judas hong tuong mipui an hong tunga, Jisua tum rangin a kôma a honga. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Jisua'n a kôma, “Judas, Miriem Nâipasal hi atumin minsûr rang ni ti mo?” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Hanchu, a kôma ruoisi om ngei han, neinun omtie an mûn chu a kôma, “Pumapa, kin khandai mang ni ung mo?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Hanchu an lâia inkhatin Ochai Inlaltak tîrlâm a chang tienga kuor a leng pea. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Ania, Jisua'n “Ahun zoi” a tia. Ha mi kuor hah a tôna a mindam pe zoi.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Hanchu, a kôma hong Ochaisingei, Biekin ulienngei, upangei, a sûr ranga hong ngei kôma Jisua'n, “Khandaingei, tôkmolngei ichôiin, puoloi sûr rang leh in-ang bangin nin hong na? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note>Nîngtin Biekina nin kôm ko oma, ni sûr rang ti mak cheia. Ania, ijîng rachamneinân roi ajêk lâi hih nin sin tho zora ani,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n Jisua a ipdel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mk 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Joh 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Hanchu, Jisua an sûra, Ochai Inlaltak ina an tuonga, Peter'n alazanin a jûia. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>In khalâidung alâitak han mei an thoa, mei rihila insungruma mei uot ngei lâia han Peter khom a vân sunga. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Nupang tîrlâm inkhatin mei kunga ânsung a mua, a mitjuoka, “Hi mi khom hih Jisua kôma om ngâi mi ani,” a tia <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Peter'n, “Nupang, ama hah riet luo riet ngâi mu-ung” tiin a minlêma. <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Anangkan uola chu mi inkhatin Peter kôma, “Nang khom an lâia mi ni ni” a tia. Peter'n, “Miriem, kei chu ni mu-ung” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Hanchu dârkârkhat suole chu midangin, “Ite okchâna boi riekin hi mi khom hih Jisua kôma om ngâi ani, Galilee mi ani sikin” ati ngita. <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Ania Peter'n, “Miriempa, ni ti ngei hah riet mu-ung” tiin a thuona. Harenghan a la chong lâi takin âr akhuong zoia. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Hanchu Pumapa hah ânheia, Peter a en ngita. Hanchu, Peter'n Pumapa'n a kôma, “Avien jân âr akhuong mân voithum ni ipdel ni tih,” ai tipe hah a rietsuoka. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Hanchu, Peter a jôkpaia, a chap ngungui zoi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua an esêla an jêm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mk 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Hanchu, a sûrngei han Jisua tusiem thonân an manga, an jêma. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>A mâi an hîp pea, “Ti roh, tumo nang a jêm?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>A chunga demna chong tamtak an thoa.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Roijêkna makunga an tuong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Joh 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Hanchu, khuo avâr lehan, upangei, Ochaisingei, Balam minchupungei an intûpa, an roijêkna Jisua an hong tuonga, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>a kôma, “Ni ril roh, Messiah nini mo?” an tia. Jisua'n, “Nangni ril khom inlang iem no tunui,” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>“Chong nangni rekel khom inlang ni thuon no tunui. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Ania, atûn renga Miriem Nâipasal hih Râtinchung Pathien chang tieng insung a tih zoi” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>An rêngin, “Nônte Pathien Nâipasal mo na ni,” an tia. An kôma, “Ani mi nin ti zoi hate” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Hanchu, “Ite rietpuipu dang nâng khâi mak me, eini rengin a ti ei riet zoi,” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Pilat makunga Jisua an tuong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joh 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Hanchu, ântûpngei murdi an inthoia, Pilat makunga Jisua an tuonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>“Hi mi hin, kin mingei anôk tieng a ruoia, Caesar kôma khom chôiruol chôi no roi,” a tipea. “Mapêna, ama reng Messiah rêng ki ni ântia, kin sûr ani,” tiin an nôna. <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilat'n, “Judangei rêng mo nani?” tiin a rekela. Hanchu, “Ani, mi ni ti zoi hate” tiin a thuona. <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Hanchu, Pilat'n, Ochaisingei le mipui ngei kôma, “Hi mi hih theiloi mintumna rang abi reng mu mu-ung” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Hannisenla, anni han, “Galilee ram renga phutin hi mun dên rakin Judea ram pumpuia, a minchua, a minjêla,” tiin an nôn uol uola.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod makunga Jisua ânding</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Hanchu, Pilat'n ha chong hah a riet lehan, “Galilee mi mo ni ni” tiin a rekela. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Galilee rama mi ani iti a rietin chu, Herod kôma a tîra; Herod khom Jerusalema a om lâitak ani. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Jisua a mûn chu a râisân oka, a thurchi a lei rieta, amu rang a nuomna a lei sôt zoi sikin. Jisua sininkhêl mu rang khom a sabei sa ani. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Masikin, Herod'n chong rekelna tamtak a neia, ania, Jisua'n thuon maka. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Ochai Inlalngei le Balam minchupungei mântieng an hôn thîna, Jisua an nôn uol uola. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herod le a râlmingeiin Jisua an phenênga, esêl takin tusiem thonân an manga; male kancholi inchuol an minhaka, Pilat kôm an tîr nôk zoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Hâni lelea han Herod le Pilat hah mal an inchanga, ma mâna han chu râla lei om an ni.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a thi ranga an jêkmasatna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joh 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Hanchu, Pilat'n Ochaisingei, ruoipungei, mipui ngei a koitûpa. <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>An kôma, “Hi mi hin mipui ngei aletieng a ruoisiet, tiin ko kôm nin hong tuonga, ania, hin nin makung renga ke ena, nin nôn lam angin ite theiloina man mu-ung. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Herod khomin a theiloina man maka, masikin ei kôma a hongtîr nôk ani. Athina rang dôrin hi mi hin ite tho minchâina nei mak. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Masikin jêm ka ta mojôk ki tih”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu rachang 17 na anbôka: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kalkân kût rachamin Pilat'n mi intâng inkhat an rangin a mojôk pe ngei ngâia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mk 15:6 nah en roh).</char></note> a tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>(Kalkân kût rachamin Pilat'n mi intâng inkhat an rangin a mojôk pe ngâi ani)<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Mipui ngeiin an hêta, “That roh, kin rangin Barabbas mi mojôk pe roh” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barabbas chu khopuia injêlna le mithat sika jêlina intâng ani. <verse eid="LUK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilat'n chu Jisua mojôk rang a nuom sikin, mipui ngei kôma atharin a ti nôka. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Hannisenla, an hêtkhuma, “Khrosa jêmdel roh, Khrosa jêmdel roh” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilat'n, avoithumnân, an kôma, “Imo a tho minchâina? Athina rangin a minchâina mu mu-ung! jêm ka ta, mojôk ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Hannisenla, rôl inring theidôrin, Jisua chu khrosa jêmdel rangin an ti ngita. Hanchu an iniekin a mene zoia.<verse eid="LUK 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>An ngên lam angin Pilat'n aroi a masata; <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>an nuom lam angin, injêlna sika mithata intângpu a mojôk pea, Jisua chu an ning an nuoma an lo rangin an kôma a pêk ngei zoi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua an jêmdel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joh 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Hanchu, râlmingeiin Jisua an tuonga, an se lâiin a riming Simon Cyrene mi khosûng renga khopuilien hong pan an tonga. An sûra, khros an min ruputa, Jisua nûka an min lôna.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Mipui tamtakin an jûia, an lâia nupang senkhat ngei chu an châa, an chapa. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Jisua'n an tieng ânheia, “Jerusalem nupangngei o, micha no roi, nangni le nin nâingei rangin chap roi. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Nikhuo a hong tung tir zoi, mingeiin, ‘nupang a chingngei, nâi vong ngâi loi ngei, nâi neiloingei chu an ralvân asa pe bah na!’ la tîng an tih. <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Ha tikin chu mingeiin muolngei kôma, ‘Ni del roh,’ la tîng an tih. Muolngei kôma, ‘Ni thup roh’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Chph 6:16</ref></char></note> la tîng an tih. <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Thing aringa luo hi ang takin a thôn te, achâr vanga te i ang takin mo tho ta nih,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Hanchu, midang inik, mipuoloi, ama leh that sa rangin an tuonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Hanchu, “Luru mun” an ti mun an tungin chu mahan Jisua khrosa an jêmdela, mipuoloi inik a voitieng inkhat a chang tieng inkhat. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Lap 22:18</ref></char></note> Jisua'n, “O Pa, ngâidam ngei roh, imo an tho an riet loi kêng,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu ommak </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jisua'n, “O Pa! anni ngei ngâidam ngei roh, an sintho an riet loi kêng” a tia.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Lap 22:18</ref></char></note> a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Hanchu taruo sânin a puon an insema. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Lap 22:7</ref></char></note>Hanchu mipui indingin an thîra, Juda ruoipungeiin, “Mi dangngei chu a mojôk ngâia, Pathien ithang, ani tatakin chu, a thenin jôk rese” tiin an êroa. <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Lap 69:21</ref></char></note> Râlmingei khomin an khorâia; a kôma an honga ju thûr an pêka. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>A chunga, “Judangei rêng na nîn chu ne theiin jôk roh bah!” an tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>A chunga, “Hi mi hih Judangei Rêng ani” iti miziek a oma.<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Mipuoloi inkhat an makhâi han êro chongin a kôma, “Messiah nimak che mo? jôk inla, keini khom mi mojôk sa roh” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Inkhatpa han a ngoa a kôma, “Pathien ni chi loi mo? Ama leh in-ang banga dûk min mintong hih. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Eini chu ei sintho man ei man rangtum piel ei man ani, aniatachu, ama chu ite tho minchâina nei mak,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Hanchu, Jisua kôma, “Jisua Rêngin nu juong tikin ni riettit roh,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n a kôma, “Chong kên khâm, avien ko kôma Paridise'a om ni tih,” a tipea.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua thina roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joh 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Hanchu, sûnlâi dâr sômleinik renga kholoi dârthum dênin, nisa avâr ân ngama, ram pumpui a jîngkhap zoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Jôk 26:31-33</ref></char></note> Hanchu, Biekina puonjâr hah inikin a kêrphata. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Lap 31:5</ref></char></note> Jisua'n rôl inring takin ânieka, “O Pa, na kuta ka ratha ka bâng,” a tia. Mahah a ti zoiin chu a rang achat zoi.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Hanchu, râlmi ulienpu han neinun omtie a mûn chu, “Inkhel loiin midik ani khet” tiin Pathien a minpâk zoia.<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Ha enhoi ithîra mipui intûpngei han neinun omtie an mûn chu, ngâisieta rôp ruchumin an in tieng an kîr nôk zoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char></note> Jisua mêlrietngei le nupangngei murdi Galilee ram renga ama hong jûingeiin lâtaka indingin an thîra.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua an phûm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51"/>Hanchu Judea ram, Arimathea khuo mi a riming Joseph a oma. Ama hah midik, mi mirit om, Pathien Rêngram juong tung rang lei ngâk mi ania. Roijêkpungei lâia mi inkhat nikhomrese an roi masat lam le an sintho lam nuom loi mi ani. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Pilat kôma a sea Jisua ruok a zonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Hanchu ruok hah a musuma, rosom puonin a thoma, thân, lungkuo ihel tute la minjâlna ngâi loia a min jâla. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Hanchu, sûn rangnga ni ania, Sabath ni phut rang ani zoia. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Galilee ram renga nupang Jisua hong jûi ngei hah Joseph ngei leh an sea, thân le Jisua ruok an dar tie khom an mua. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Jôk 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Bal 5:14</ref></char></note> Hanchu ina an sea, mirimhoi le sariekngei ruok pol rangin an sinsiema.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Balam angin Sabathnin chu an ingam zoi.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua inthoinôkna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joh 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Pathienni jîng, inmâna, nupangngeiin mirimhoi an sin hah chôiin thâna an sea. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Thân kotbâia lung hah inluoipai sân an va mua. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Hanchu, an lûta, ania, Pumapa Jisua ruok chu mu khâi mak ngei. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Mahan mulungjîngin an indinga, harenghan, mi inik puon chek insilin an kôla an juong indinga. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Nupangngei han rolo innîkin nuoia an inbok raka, anni han an kôma, “Ithomo mi ring hah mithingei lâia nin irok? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6,7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> Hin om khâi maka, ânthoinôk zoi. Galilee rama a om lâia nin kôma ai ti ngei hah riettit roi. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>Miriem Nâipasal hih mi nunsie ngei kuta ipêk nîng a ta, jêmdel an ta, a sûnthum nîn a ringin inthoi nôk a tih” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Hanchu, nupangngei han ai ti ngei hah an rietsuok nôka, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>thân renga an kîra, neinun omtie ngei chu ruoisi sômleikhat ngei le midangngei an rila. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Nupangngei hah Mary Magdalene, Joanna, le Mary, Jacob nungei anni. Anni le nupang adang an kôma omngei han tîrtonngei hah an ril ani. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Ania nupangngei chongril hah, chongkâmboi an tia, taksôn mak ngei. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu rachang 12 na ommak.</char></note> Nikhomrese, Peter chu ân thoilita, thân tieng a tâna, ân kûna, rosom puon injuot tiloi chu ite dang mu maka. Hanchu, neinun omtie ngei kamâmin in tieng a kîr nôk zoi.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emmau khuoa an se</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mk 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ma ni nanâk han Jisua jûi ngâi mi inik Emmau khuoa an sea, Jerusalem renga kilometer sômleikhat dôra la ani. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>An ruonin neinun omtie ngei hah an misîra. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Ha anga an chonga an misîr lâiin, Jisua lelên a hong nâia an kôma a lôna. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>An mua chu riet minthâr mak ngei. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Ama'n an kôma, “Lampuia nin misîr hah ithurchi mini?” a tia. Hanchu mâi inngûi riemin an indinga. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Hanchu, a riming Cleopas han a kôma, “Jerusalema sûnkhat vai mo no om? Sûntômte lei vuna neinun omtie ngei hah ni riet loi mo?” tiin a rekela. <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>“I neinun mo?” a tia. “Nazareth Jisua chunga neinun tungngei hah; ha mi hah Pathien le mitin mindon khoma jâttinrêng ai ti le ai sin, racham inei dêipu ania, <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>kin Ochaisingei le ruoipungeiin that rangin an pêka, an jêmdela. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Ama hah Isreal minjôk rang mi nîng a tih iti kin tûnga. Mapêna, ha anga neinun tungna hah avien hin a sûnthumni ani zoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Kin champui nupang senkhat, jînga thân va en ngeiin kin mulung an minjînga. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>A ruok mu loiin an hongkîr nôka, vântîrton inlâr kin mua, a ring nôk zoi an ti, an hong tia. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Hanchu, kin champui senkhat ngeiin thâna an va sea, nupangngei ti lam anghan an va mua, ama chu mu khâi mak ngei” an tia.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Male, Jisua'n an kôma, “Amo ngei o, dêipungei neinuntin an lei rilngei hah idôra a iem innu mo nin ni? <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Messiah han ha ngei murdi tuongin a roiinpuina ai lût rang nimak mo?” a tia <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n ama chungroi, Moses lekhabu renga dêipungei lei miziek lekhabungei a rilminthâr pe ngeia.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Hanchu, an sêna rang khuo an hong nâi zoia, Jisua hah la se bang rang angin a oma, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Nikhomrese bâiin an sûra, “Kin kôma om ta roh, sûn aheka ajîng rang kêng ani zoi” an tia. Hanchu an kôma om rangin a se zoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Hanchu, an kôma sâk rangin ânsung lâiin vâipôl a lâka, sat a vura, a khoia, a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Hanchu an mit a hong vâra, an rietminthâr zoia, hannirese, an mitmu renga ânmang nôk kelena. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>“Lampuia ei kôma, Mi chongpuia, lekhabungei mi rilminthâr pe lâia han mei a kâng angin om mak me mo?” tiin an inrekela. <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Harenghan, an inthoia, Jerusalema an kîr nôka, ruoisi sômleikhat ngei le Adangngei lei intûp an va mua. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>“Pumapa chu ânthoinôk tatak; Simon kôma khom ânlâr zoi” an lei tia. <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Hanchu, ha inik ngei khom han, lampuia neinun omtie le vâipôl a khoia Pumapa an rietminthâr tie an rilminthâr ngei zoi.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n a ruoisi sômleikhat ngei kôma ânlârna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joh 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sin 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Hanchu, mi inik ngei han an la ril lâitakin, harenghan Pumapa lele an lâia ândinga an kôma, “Nin chunga ratha'ngamna om rese”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhat ngeiin chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nin chunga rathangamna om rese </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hih dôn mak ngei</char></note> a tia.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>An jâminzal sabaka, khori an mûn an mindona. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Hanniresea, an kôma, “Ithomo nin mulung nin minjînga? Ithomo nin mulunga iem zoiloina nin inei? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Ka kut, ke kephangei en ta u, keima nanâk hah ki ni hih! Ni tôn ungla, en roi, minin mu anghan khori'n taksa le ru nei mak” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Hanchu, mahah a ti zoiin chu, a kut le a kephangei a min en ngeia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu rachâng 40 nah ommak.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>An râisân rai sikin taksôn thei kelen mak ngeia, an kamâm sabak lâiin an kôma, “Asâk ruo imokhat mo nan nei?” tiin a rekel ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Nga suong sai tangkhat an pêka. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Alâka, an mu chungin a sâka.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Hanchu, an kôma, “Hi chongngei lele hih ani, nin kôma ko om lâia ku chungroi Moses Balam lekhabua miziek, Dêipungei miziek, Minpâkna labua miziek, a hongtung dik rang nangni ke lei ril ngâi hah,” a tia. <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Hanchu, lekhabua ânziekngei an riet theina rangin an mulungrîlngei a mo-ong pe ngeia. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>An kôma, “hi angin miziek ani, Messiah han dûk tuong a ta, sûnthum suole thina renga inthoi nôk a tih. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Ama rimingin insîrna le nunsie ngâidamna thurchi Jerusalem renga namtin kôma misîr nîng a tih. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Ha neinunngei murdi rietpuipu nin ni. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Sin 1:4</ref></char></note> Hanchu, ka Pa ânkhâm hah keima rengin nin chunga juongtîr ki tih, hannirese, chungtieng renga sinthotheina nin chunga a chum mâka chu khopuilien ha nin ngâk tit rang ani,” a tia.<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua invâna a kal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:19-20">Mat 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sin 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Hanchu, khopuilien renga Bethany dênin a ruoi ngeia, mahan a bân a phara, sat a vur ngeia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:50,51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sin 1:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Ha anga sat a vur lâitakin, ânsenpui ngeia, ama chu invâna tuongin a om zoi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu ommak </char><char style="fq" closed="false">male invâna tuongin a om zoi.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Hanchu chubai an mûka, râisân takin Jerusalema an kîrnôk zoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Hanchu, Biekina Pathien kôma râisânchong rilin an zorangei murdi an mang zoi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
